a
A, An,Ⓐ(As an article) not ex.; ‘a man’ naraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (One) eka.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Indefinite) kiM with cit, cana or api.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 With part., ex. by dat. or inf.; ‘set out a-hunting’ mfgayAyE or mfgayAM kartuM pratasTe; ‘fell a-weeping’ kraMdituM pravfttaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 (Every) prati in comp., or by repetition of word; ‘100 Rs. a day’ pratidinaM or dine dine SatarUpakaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 (Species) viSezaH, BedaH, in comp.; ‘dog is an animal’ SvA prARiviSezaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abandon
