about
About,Ⓒprep.Ⓓpari; pari-i ‘go a(bout)’ &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 deSIya (with numerals); ‘a(bout) five years old’ paMcavarzadeSIyaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Regarding) ADikftya, prati, uddiSya; saMbadDa-anuvidDa-gata-vizaye in comp.; ‘I ask a(bout) my friend’ mitragataM pfcCAmi; parAjayAnuvidDA AlApAH &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 kfte, arTe, arTaM, hetoH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 paritaH, aBitaH, (acc.); samIpaM, samIpe, pArSvataH, nikawe, (loc.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 (Nearly) with numerals upa, Asanna, adUra, in comp.; upacaturAH ‘a(bout) four’.<BR>Ⓔadv.Ⓓ(Showing prospective fut.) ex. by fut. part., unmuKa (KI f.), udyata, Asanna, or desid.; anuyAsyan munitanayAM (S. 1) ‘a(bout) to follow’ &c.; jiGAMsyamAno naraH ‘a(bout) to be killed’; AsannamaraRaH ‘a(bout) to die’; AsannarAjyanASaH ‘a(bout) to lose the realm’.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 prAya-kalpa, in comp.; ‘it is a(bout) noon’ maDyAhna-prAyaH-kalpaH-samayaH; ‘what are you a(bout)’ kiM kartumudyatosi, kiMkAryavyagrosi, kimAraMBastvaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 paritaH, aBitaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 itastataH, sTAnAtsTAnaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

