beat
Beat,Ⓒs.ⒹAGAtaH, prahAraH; tAqanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 spaMdanaM, sPuraRaM.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓtaq 10, prahf 1 P, tud 6 P, aBihan 2 P, Ahan 2 A, (AhatAyAM payARaBeryAM).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (defeat) viDvaMs c., BaMj 7 P, parAji 1 A, parABU 1 U.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 Aluq c., cUrR 10.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹspaMd-kaMp-vep 1 A, sPur 6 P; ‘b(eat) very fast’ DamaDamAyate (D.).<BR>Ⓝ[Beat] down,Ⓐnipat c.; (price) nyUnIkf.<BR>Ⓝ[Beat] into,ⒶtAqanena kf or nirmA 3 A; ‘I shall b(eat) thee into a good boy’ tAqayitvA tAqayitvA tvAmahaM vidvAMsaM karizyAmi.<BR>Ⓝ[Beat] off,Ⓐvidru c., pratihan.<BR>Ⓝ[Beat] about the bush,Ⓐ(lit.) vanaM grah 9 P or Aluq 10; (fig.) aprastutamAlap 1 P; See Bush.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=030" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

