breathe
Breathe,Ⓒv. i.ⒹSvas 2 P; prAR 2 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 as 2 P, jIv 1 P, vft 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 A-pratyA-samA-Svas; ‘b(reathe) deep’ dIrGa-sTUlaMsTUlaM niSvas; ‘b(reathe) freely’ ucCvas; ‘b(reathe) the last’ See Die.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓ(out) udgF 6 P, ava-pra-saM-kF 6 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pravA 2 P.<BR>ⓃBreath,Ⓒs.ⒹSvAsaH, niSvAsaH, ucCvasitaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 prARAH (pl.); prARAyAmaH ‘holding the b(reath)’; asavaH (pl.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=42" target="_blank">Page42</a>] virAmaH upaSamaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 udgAraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 maMdAnilaH, mfduvAtaH; ‘in the same b(reath)’ ekAvasare, samakAlameva.<BR>Ⓝ[Breath]ing,Ⓒs.ⒹSvAsaH, SvasitaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 spfhA, icCA; ‘b(reathing) through nose’ nAsikaMDamaH; ‘b(reathing) hole’ vAtAyana, gavAkzaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Breath]less,Ⓒa.ⒹprARahIna, nirucCvAsa, vicetana.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 mfta, utkrAMtavAyu.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 yazwiprARa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=041" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

