come
Come,Ⓒv. i.ⒹAgam 1 P, AyA 2 P, A-i 2 P; upasTA 1 U, Avraj 1 P, A-aBi-pad 4 A; ‘c(ome) what may’ yadBAvi tadBavatu; ‘c(ome) harm, c(ome) good’ yadBAvi tadBavatu SuBamaSuBaM vA.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] about,ⒶsaMvft 1 A, saMBU, Apat 1 P; ‘c(ome) across’; See Meet.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] back,Ⓐnivft, pratyAgam.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] at, or [Come] by,ⒶSee Get.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] down,ⒶavatF 1 P, avaruh 1 P, avapat 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] down upon,Ⓐ(sahasA-raBasA) avaskaMd 1 P, Apat 1 P, aBidru 1 P, Akram 1 U, 4 P. ‘c(ome) down with’ deyaM dA 3 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] forth,Ⓐnirgam, niHsf 1 P, ‘c(ome) in’ vaSI BU 1 P; vaSaM-gam 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] into,ⒶpraviS 6 P; ‘c(ome) into trouble’ vipadABiBU, Apadgrasta a. BU.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] near,ⒶSee Approach.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] of,ⒶSee Arise.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] off, [Come] out,Ⓐnizkram; nirgam, udi 2 P; ‘came out successful’ jayI baBUva.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pravft, saMpad, nivft, avaso pass. ‘c(ome) out’ prasidDiM gam.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] over,ⒶASri 1 U. ‘c(ome) round’, prakftiM Apad.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] short,ⒶnyUnIBU.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] to,ⒶsakASaM Agam-yA-i, prAp 5 P, prakftimApad 4 A; See Amount; ‘c(ome) to a head’ pAkaM vraj 1 P; sapUya a. BU; ‘c(ome) to blows’ anyonyaM prahartuM AraB 1 A. ‘c(ome) to life’ ujjIv 1 P; ‘came to nothing’ tasya ko'pi pariRAmo nAsIt, nizPalaM-nirguRaM-baBUva; ‘c(ome) to pass’, Apat, samApad, saMvft; ‘c(ome) to oneself’ prakftimApad 4 A, saMjYAM-cetanAM-laB 1 A or pratipad, prakftO sTA; ‘c(ome) to terms’, saMDiM kf 8 U. ‘c(ome) under’ samAviS 6 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] up to,ⒶsamupAgam, samAyA, samupasf-sfp.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] up with,ⒶAsad c., prAp.<BR>Ⓝ[Come] upon,ⒶA-samA-pat, upasTA, Akram.<BR>Ⓝ[Com]ing,Ⓒs.ⒹAgamanaM.<BR>Ⓔa.Ⓓ(to come) AgAmin; ‘on the c(oming) Monday’ AgAmini somavAsare; BAvin, uttara; ‘time to c(ome)’ uttarakAlaH; ‘c(oming) generations’, s. putrapOtrAH; uttarakAlInA janAH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=065" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

