Comfort,Ⓒv. t.ⒹsamA-A-Svas c., sAMtv 10.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMtuz c., AnaMd c., hfz c., suKaM dA 3 U, suKin a. kf 8 U; ‘c(omfort) yourself’ samASvasihi.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹASvAsanaM, sAMtvanaM; saMtozaRaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 suKaM, susTatA, sOKyaM, svAsTyaM, nirvfti f.<BR>Ⓝ[Comfort]able,Ⓒa.ⒹsuKakara (rI f.), suKada; suKaSayitaM prazwuM (S. 4) ‘to ask whether she had a c(omfortable) sleep’.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ASvAsaka, SAMtida, kleSApaha, klamavinodaka.<BR>Ⓝ[Comfort]ably,Ⓒadv. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=66" target="_blank">Page66</a>]ⒹsuKaM, yaTAsuKaM; nikAmaM; ‘I canʼt sleep c(omfortably) even at night’ rAtrAvapi nikAmaM SayitavyaM nAsti (S. 2).<BR>Ⓝ[Comfort]er,Ⓒs.ⒹASvAsakaH, saMtozadaH, SokApahartf^1 m., sAMtvavAdaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 OrRaM kaMWAvaguMWanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Comfort]less,Ⓒa.ⒹnirAnaMda, suKarahita, saMtozahIna<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170505.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=065" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

