confide
Confide,Ⓒv. i.ⒹviSvas 2 P, prati-i 2 P, SradDA 3 U; ‘she was made to c(onfide) in a false man’ asatyasaMDe jane padaM kAritA (S. 4).<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓnikzip 6 P, nyas 4 P (with loc.), sam-f c. (arpayati); ‘have you kept the secret c(onfid)ed to you’ api rakzyate rahasyanikzepaH (V. 2).<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ant,Ⓒs.ⒹviSvAsa-viSraMBa-BUmi f., saKi m., vayasyaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (of a woman) saKI, vayasyA, Ali-lI f.<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ence,Ⓒs.ⒹviSvAsaH, viSraMBaH, pratyayaH; SradDA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 niScayaH, dfQapratyayaH, dfQajYAnaM, asaMSayaH; ‘enter into c(onfidence)’ viSvAsaM gam 1 P or vraj 1 P; ‘raising of c(onfidence)’ viSvAsopagamaH; ‘inspire with c(onfidence)’ viSvAsaM nI 1 P; viSvas c.; ‘take into c(onfidence)’ viSraMBasTAne man 4 A; ‘self-c(onfidence)’ pragalBatA, prAgalByaM, DfzwatA, ‘an object of c(onfidence)’ viSvAsaBUmiH, viSraMBasTAnaM-BAjanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ent,Ⓒa.ⒹviSvAsin, viSvAsapratipanna-viSvasta, jAtapratyaya, viSrabDa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 niScita, asaMdeha, CinnasaMSaya; ‘he is c(onfident) of success’ jayaM niScitaM (DruvaM) manyate.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pragalBa, Dfzwa, nirviSaMka, sAhasin.<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ential,Ⓒa.ⒹviSvasta, viSrabDa; Apta (AptajanaH); ‘c(onfidential) talk’ viSraMBAlApaH; ‘c(onfidential) matter’ viSvAsakAryaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 gupta, aprakASya, saMvaraRIya.<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]entially,Ⓒadv.ⒹviSrabDaM; guptaM<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ing,Ⓒa.ⒹviSvAsApanna, viSvAsaBAj, viSvasta, jAtapratyaya, viSrabDa, aviSaMkamAna, niHSaMka.<BR>Ⓝ[Confid]ingly,Ⓒadv.ⒹviSrabDaM, sapratyayaM, nirviSaMkaM, niHsaMdehaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=072" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

