congruous
Congruous,Ⓒa.Ⓓyogya, ucita, saMgata, avirudDa, anuguRa, anurUpa, sadfSa (SI f.), saMbadDa.<BR>Ⓝ[Congruous]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹyuktaM, anurUpaM, saMgataM.<BR>ⓃCongruity, Congruence,Ⓒs.ⒹsaMgatatA, anurUpatA, yuktatA, sAdfSyaM; oft. ex. by kva-kva; ‘what c(ongruity) is there between this (youthful), age and this restraint of passions’ kvedaM vayaH kveyamiMdriyARAmupaSAMtiH (Ka. 135)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjecture
Conjecture,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓtark 10, anumA 3 A, 2 P, Uh 1 A, utprekz 1 A, (kimutprekzase kutastyoyamiti U. 4).<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹtarkaH, vitarkaH, UhaH-hanaM, anumAnaM; ‘your c(onjecture) is clear (you have rightly c(onjectur)ed)’ prasannaH-upapannaH-te tarkaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjectur]al,Ⓒa.ⒹAnumAnika (kI f.).<BR>Ⓝ[Conjectur]ally,Ⓒadv.ⒹanumAnena, savitarkaM, anumAnapUrvakaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjoin
Conjoin,Ⓒv. t.ⒹsaMyuj 7 U, 10, saMSliz c., saMDA 3 U; ‘c(onjoin)ed in bonds of friendship’ mitraBAvena vartamAnAH, parasparAnuraktAH.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹsaMyuj-saMSliz-saMDA- pass.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjoin]ed, Conjoint,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMhata, saMyukta, saMSlizwa, saMbadDa.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjoint]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹsamaM, sahitaM, saMhata a.; saMBUya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugal
Conjugal,Ⓒa.ⒹvEvAhika (kI f.); oft. ex. by daMpatI; ‘c(onjugal) love’ daMpatyoH prema; ‘c(onjugal) fidelity’ avyaBicAraH; satItvaM, pAtivratya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugate
Conjugate,Ⓒv. t.ⒹrUpARi AKyA 2 P.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹsaMyukta.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjugat]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹgaRaH; ‘1st c(onjugation)’ BvAdigaRaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMyogaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjunct
Conjunct,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMyukta, saMSlizwa; ‘a c(onjunct) consonant’ saMyogaH, yogaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjunct]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹsaMyogaH, yogaH, saMSlezaH, saMsargaH, samAgamaH, saMgamaH; saMgaH<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 samuccayaH; ‘c(onjunction) of planets’ saMgamaH; ‘lunar c(onjunction)’ amAvAsyA, amA.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjunct]ive,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMyukta, saMSlizwa, yOgika (kI f.).<BR>Ⓝ[Conjunct]ure,Ⓒs.ⒹyogaH, saMyogaH, saMDiH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avasaraH, samayaH, prastAvaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjure
Conjure,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓmuh c., maMtrEvaSaM nI 1 P; mAyAM kf 8 U, aBicar 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saSapaTaM AdiS 6 P, Sap c.; ‘I c(onjure) thee by my life (soul)’ SApitAsi mama jIvitena (Mal. 8); aByarT 10 A, saSapaTaM saMbuD c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (in mind) anu-saM-smf 1 P; ciMt 10.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹsaSApaTaM EkamatyaM-kUwaM-kf 8 U, saMSap 1 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjur]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹmAyA, iMdrajAlaM, kuhakaH, maMtraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 SApanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 saSapaTaH saMkalpaH, saMSapanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Conjur]er,Ⓒs.ⒹiMdra-EMdra-jAlikaH, mAyin m., AhituMqikaH, kuhakakft m., kuhakAjIvaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connate
Connate,Ⓒa.Ⓓsahaja, ekakAlotpanna, sahajAta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

