connect
Connect,Ⓒv. i.ⒹsaM-anu-baMD 9 P, saMyuj 7 U, 10, saMSliz c., saMDA 3 U, vyatizaMj 1 P, saMnah 4 P, saMyu 2 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Connect]ed,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMyukta, saMbadDa, anvita, sAnvaya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avicCeda, avirata, avi-cCinna, ‘a c(onnected) narrative’ kaTAprabaMDaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Connect]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹsaMyogaH, anuzaMgaH, saMsargaH, saMgaH; ‘in c(onnection) with’ anubaDya, uddiSya, ADikftya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMbaMDa, saMparkaH, anvayaH, saMdarBaH, samanvayaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 baMDuH, bAMDavaH, jYAtiH; ‘to have c(onnection) with’ saMgam 1 A, aBigam 1 P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connive
Connive,Ⓒv. i.Ⓓ(at) kAmataH upekz 1 A, jYAnaM nihnu 2 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 kzam 1 A, sah 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 akzi saMkuc 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Conniv]ance,Ⓒs.ⒹupekzA, jYAnApahnavaH, kAmataH upekzA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 kzamA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 akzisaMkocanaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connoisseur
Connoisseur,Ⓒs.ⒹguRajYaH, parIkzakaH, aBijYaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connubial
Connubial,Ⓒa.ⒹvEvAhika (kI f.); daMpatI in comp.; ‘c(onnubial) love’ daMpatIsnehaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conquer
Conquer,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓji 1 P, vi-parA-ji 1 A, aBi-parABU 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nigrah 9 P, ni-saM-yam 1 P, dam c. (damayati), vaSIkf 8 U, svAyattIkf; ‘one who has c(onquer)ed his passions’ jiteMdriyaH, saMyateMdriyaH, vaSI, dAMtaH, saMyamI.<BR>Ⓝ[Conquer]able,Ⓒa.Ⓓjeya, aBiBavanIya.<BR>Ⓝ[Conquer]or,Ⓒs.Ⓓjetf m., vijetf, jayin m., jit in comp.; viSvajit ‘c(onqueror) of the world’.<BR>ⓃConquest,Ⓒs.ⒹjayaH, vijayaH, vaSIkaraRaM, aBiBavaH, jayanaM, svAyattIkaraRaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 jitapradeSaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consanguineous
Consanguineous,Ⓒa.ⒹekaSarIra, ekapiMqa, sapiMqa, sagotra.<BR>ⓃConsanguinity,Ⓒs.ⒹsagotratA, sapiMqatA; ekaSarIrAnvayaH, saMbaMDitvaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscience
Conscience,Ⓒs.ⒹsadasadvicAraSakti f., saMjYAnaM; oft. ex. by manas n., aMtaHkaraRaM; ‘biting of c(onscience)’ paScAttApaH, manastApaH.<BR>ⓃConscientious,Ⓒa.ⒹnirvyAja, amAya, SudDamati, nyAyaparAyaRa, fjuprakfti.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 puRyAtman, puRyaSIla, nyAyavartin.<BR>Ⓝ[Conscientious]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹSudDamanasA, nirvyAjaM, SudDaBAvena.<BR>Ⓝ[Conscientious]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹmatiSudDi f.; SucitA, puRyaSIlatvaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscionable
Conscionable,Ⓒa.ⒹnyAyya, yogya, yaTArTa<BR>ⓃConscionably,Ⓒadv.ⒹyaTArTaM, DarmataH, nyAyena.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscious
Conscious,Ⓒa.ⒹEx. by jYa, vid or aBijYa in comp. or by verbs for ‘know’ q. v. ‘not c(onscious) of pain’ vedanAnaBijYa; ‘I am perfectly c(onscious) of my defects’ svadozAn dfQaM Kalu jAne.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sacetana, satarka, jYAnin, pratiboDavat; ‘to be c(onscious) of’ jYA 9 P; viBU c., (nAtmAnamapi viBAvayati S. 4), cit 10 A; See Know.<BR>Ⓝ[Conscious]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹjYAnAt, budDipUrvaM, jYAnataH, kAmataH.<BR>Ⓝ[Conscious]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹjYAnaM, upalabDi f., cetanA, cEtanyaM, saMjYA, vedanaM, anuBavaH, boDaH, pratiboDaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscript
Conscript,Ⓒs.ⒹnavayodDf m.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹliKitanAman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecrate
Consecrate,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓ(an idol) pratizWA c. (pratizWApayati); pavitrIkf 8 U, saMskf, aBi-anu-maMtr 10 A, (vAmadevAnumaMtrito'SvaH U. 2).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 aBizic 6 P, prokz 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 upa-pra-vini-yuj 7 A, 10, nikzip 6 P, vi-ut-sfj 6 P, upakxp c.<BR>Ⓝ[Consecrat]ed,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMskfta, pratizWApita, viniyojita, upakalpita.<BR>Ⓝ[Consecrat]er,Ⓒs.ⒹsaMskartf m., pratizWApakaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Consecrat]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹsaMskAraH, pratizWApanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 utsargaH, viniyogaH, upayogaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=074" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecution
Consecution,Ⓒs.ⒹkramaH, anukramaH, prabaMDaH, anvayaH, paraMparA, SreRI, mAlA.<BR>ⓃConsecutive,Ⓒa.ⒹkramAgata, anupUrva; avirata, niraMtara, saprabaMDa, saMtata.<BR>Ⓝ[Consecutive]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹkrameRa, yaTAkramaM, yaTApurvaM; avirataM, avicCedaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Consecutive]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹAnupUrvyaM, avicCedaH, prabaMDaH, saMtatatA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=075" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

