consonant
Consonant,Ⓒs.ⒹvyaMjanaM; ‘conjunct c(onsonant)’ saMyogaH, yogaH.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹavirudDa, anusArin, anurUpa, yogya, anuguRa.<BR>Ⓝ[Consonant]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹanusAreRa, anurUpaM.<BR>ⓃConsonance,Ⓒs.ⒹaviroDaH, anusAraH, anuroDaH, AnurUpyaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

