Conspicuous,Ⓒa.Ⓓvyakta, suprakASa, suspazwa, puraHsPurat (tI-ntI f.), pratyakza.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 utkfzwa, niratiSaya, pramuKa, viSizwa.<BR>Ⓝ[Conspicuous]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹspazwaM, vyaktaM; viSizwatayA.<BR>Ⓝ[Conspicuous]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹvyaktatA, spazwatA, viSizwatA, utkfzwatA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspire
Conspire,Ⓒv. i.Ⓓupajap 1 P, kUwaM rac 10. kusAhityaM kf 8 U, kUwArTaM saMSap 1 U.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMmil 6 P, anukUla a. BU; ‘all things c(onspir)ed to make him happy’ sarvaM tasya suKAyAkalpata-aBavat.<BR>Ⓝ[Conspir]acy,Ⓒs.ⒹupajApaH, kapawaprabaMDaH, kusAhityaM, kumaMtraRA; ‘c(onspiracy) against the king’ rAjadrohaH, drohaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Conspir]ator,Ⓒs.ⒹupajApakaH, kusaMsargin m.; saMSaptakaH, SapaTabadDaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 rAjadrohin m.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 viSvAsaGAtakaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

