Constant,Ⓒa.ⒹsTira, dfQa, acala, niScala.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 SASvata (tI f.), satata, prasakta, avirata, anavarata, nitya, sanAtana (nI f.), niraMtara; ‘c(onstant) wife’ satI, pativratA.<BR>Ⓝ[Constant]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹsatataM, anavarataM, avirataM, aBIkzRaM, nityaM, aniSaM, ajasraM, sarvadA, sarvakAlaM.<BR>ⓃConstancy,Ⓒs.ⒹsTEryaM, sTiratA, niScalatA, dfQatA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 aBiniveSaH, nirbaMDaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 sAtatyaM, avirAmaH, nEraMtaryaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 dfQA BaktiH, dfQasOhfdaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

