constitute
Constitute,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓrac 10, nirmA 3 A, viDA 3 U; gen. ex. by Atmaka, rUpa, maya (yI f.), in comp., or by BU 1 P, asU 2 P; ‘we c(onstitute) thy army’ tava sEnyaM vayaM smaH; ‘what c(onstitute)s greatness’ mAhimA kena jAyate; See Compose.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMsTA c. (sTApayati), pratizWA c.; niyuj 7 A, 10, samAdiS 6 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Constitut]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹracanA, GawanA, nirmARaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avasTA, daSA, rUpaM, vftti f.; BAvaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vyavasTA; viDiyaMtraRaM, niyamaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 rAjanIti f., rAjyavyavasTA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 prakfti f., svaBAvaH, SarIrAvasTA; janma-prakfti-svaBAvaH; ‘of a sickly c(onstitution)’ janmarogin, aSakta, prakftidurbala.<BR>Ⓝ[Constitut]ional,Ⓒa.ⒹviDyanusArin, vyavasTAnurUpa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 prakfti in comp.<BR>Ⓝ[Constitut]ionally,Ⓒadv.ⒹviDyanusAreRa, vyavasTAnupUrvaM.<BR>ⓃConstituent,Ⓒa.ⒹGawaka, racaka; ‘c(onstituent) parts’ GawakAvayavAH, GawakAH, aMgAni.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vAstava (vI f.), sAraBUta; ‘c(onstituent) members of a state’ rAjyAMgAni.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹEx. by a.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 niyojakaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constrain
Constrain,Ⓒv. t.ⒹbalAtkf c., pravft c., prer c.; gen. ex. by causal of verbs; See Compel.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ni-ava-ruD^1 7 U, niyaMtr 10, ni-saM-yam 1 P; ‘c(onstrain)ed silence’ balAdDftaM mOnaM; ‘c(onstrain)ed to be silent’ niyaMtritavAk, yaMtritakaTa.<BR>ⓃConstraint,Ⓒs.ⒹbalaM, balAtkAraH; ‘by c(onstraint)’ balAt, balena, anicCat a. prasahya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avaSyakatA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 yaMtraRA, niroDaH, avaroDaH; ‘c(onstraint) of modesty’ hrIyaMtraRA.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20161116.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

