construct
Construct,Ⓒv. t.ⒹnirmA 3 A, 2 P or c. (mApayati), rac 10, viDA 3 U, Gaw c. (Gawayati), prakxp c., kf 8 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Construct]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹracanA, nirmARaM, viDAnaM, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 anvayaH, saMbaMDaH, padayojanA-naM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 arTaH, ASayaH; ‘do not put a bad c(onstuction) upon his words’ tasya vacasi durASayaM mA kalpaya-Aropaya.<BR>Ⓝ[Construct]ive,Ⓒa.ⒹnirmAtf, prakalpaka, nirmARa or viDAna in comp.; nirmARacAturyaM ‘c(onstructive) skill’ &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

