consult
Consult,Ⓒv.ⒹsaMmaMtr 10 A, saMvad 1 P or c., saMBAz 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vimfS 6 P, ciMt 10, vicar c.; ‘you must c(onsult) public good also’ janahitamapi tAvat tvayA manasi kAryameva-avekzaRIyaM; ‘do not c(onsult) your private good’ svahitaparAyaRo mA BUH; ‘let astrologers be c(onsult)ed’ sAMvatsarikEH saMvAdyatAm; ‘you have given this order, having c(onsult)ed (with) my very heart’ mama hfdayena saha saMmaMtryA-dizwavAnasi (Mu. 1); ‘c(onsult) with oneself’ manasA vicar c., AtmagataM ciMt.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 nirUp 10, samIkz 1 A, A-paryA-loc 10; ‘in c(onsult)ing a horoscope’ [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=77" target="_blank">Page77</a>] janmapatrikAM vimfSan, patrikAvalokanena SuBASuBaM paryAlocayan.<BR>Ⓝ[Consult]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹmaMtraRA-RaM, vicAraRaM; vimarSaH, vicAraH; AlocanaM, saMvAdaH; ‘private c(onsultation)’ gUQamaMtraRaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Consult]ative,Ⓒa.ⒹsaMmaMtrya; maMtraRayogya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=076" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

