contain
Contain,Ⓒv. t.ⒹDf 1 P, 10, AdA 3 A, parigrah 9 P, DA 3 U, Bf 3 U; ‘c(ontain)ing’ ex. by Dara-DArin-Bft in comp.; ‘c(ontain)ing water’ toyaBft; oft. ex. by garBa, pUrRa, Atmaka in comp.; aMbugarBaH meGaH, SukagarBakowaraM; amftapUrRaM pAtraM, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nivAr 10, saMyam 1 P, nigrah 9 P; ‘he could not c(ontain) his great joy’ guruH praharzaH^1 prabaBUva nAtmani (R. iii. 17).<BR>Ⓝ[Contain]ed,Ⓒa.ⒹDfta, aMtargata, aMtarBUta, aMtargaRita; vartin, sTa in comp.<BR>Ⓝ[Contain]er,Ⓒs.ⒹADAraH, DArin-Bft in comp.; ‘the relation between c(ontainer) and contained’ ADArADeyaBAvaH.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170505.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

