contemn
Contemn,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓavaman 4 A, avajYA 9 U, avaDIr 10 A, tiraskf 8 U, avagaR 10, na Adf 6 A, upekz 1 A, laGUkf, tfRAya man, pariBU 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Contemn]er,Ⓒs.ⒹavamaMtf m., tiraskartf m.<BR>ⓃContempt,Ⓒs.ⒹavajYA, avamAnaH-mAnanA, avaDIraRA, tiraskAraH, avagaRanA, anAdaraH, pariBavaH, upekzA, avahelanaM-nA.<BR>Ⓝ[Contempt]ible,Ⓒa.ⒹavamaMtavya, tiraskArya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 kzudra, nikfzwa, nIca; ‘to make oneself c(ontemptible)’ AtmAnaM tiraskArAspadaM kf, avajYABAjanaM BU.<BR>Ⓝ[Contempt]uous,Ⓒa.ⒹavamAnin, upekzaka, pariBAvin, pariBAvuka (kI f.); sAvajYa, sAvamAna.<BR>Ⓝ[Contempt]uously,Ⓒadv.ⒹsAvajYaM, sAvamAnaM, upekzayA, satiraskAraM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

