Contemplate,Ⓒv.ⒹciMt 10; DyE 1 P; manasA vicar c., vimfS 6 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nirUp 10, nirvarRa 10, avekz 1 A, saMdfS 1 A, Aloc 10. Alok 1 A, 10.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 saMkxp c., BU c.<BR>Ⓝ[Contemplat]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹDyAnaM, ciMtA, BAvanA, AlocanaM, vicAraRA, vimarSaH; ‘to be or have in c(ontemplation)’ aBipra-i 2 P, uddiS 6 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Contemplat]ive,Ⓒa.ⒹDyAnapara, ciMtASIla, &c. sim. comp.; BAvitAtman; ciMtAvizwa, samADisTa.<BR>Ⓝ[Contemplat]or,Ⓒs.ⒹDyAtf m.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=077" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

