fair
Fair,Ⓒa.ⒹcAru, suMdara (rI f.), SoBana; See Beautiful; ex. by su in comp.; ‘the f(air) sex’ strIjanaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sama, nyAyya, yukta, uci-ta, Darmya, yaTAnyAya, nyAyavartin, Suci, fju, nirvyAja, nizkapawa; vimalAtman, SudDaDI; ‘a f(air) fight’ DarmayudDaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vimala, nirmala, SudDa, viSada, svacCa; gOra, SuBra (complexion); anaBra, niraBra, vitimira; ‘f(air) day or weather’ sudinaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 anukUla, prasanna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 maDyama; ‘he soon bids f(air) to prosper’ tenAcirAdaByudayaBAjA BavitavyamityanumIyate.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹmelA, melakaH, yAtrA, samAjaH; hawwaH, ni-zadyA, nigamaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Fair]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹnyAyena, yaTAnyAyaM, DarmataH, DarmeRa, nizkapawaM, nyAyyaM, yaTArhaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Fair]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹsOMdaryaM, cArutA, SrIH, SoBA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Fair dealing) sAralyaM, SucitA, nyAyyatA, ArjavaM, avyAjaH, samatA amAyA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vimalatA, SudDi f., prasAdaH. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=153" target="_blank">Page153</a>]<BR>ⓃFairy,Ⓒs.ⒹvidyADarI, piSAcI, yoginI, rAkzasI.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

