get
Get,Ⓒv. t.ⒹlaB 1 A, Ap 5 P, arj 1 P or c., A-samA-sad c., vid 6 U, prati-A-pad 4 A, aS 5 A, aDigam 1 P, grah 9 U, A-dA 3 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (To be produced) jan 4 A, utpad 4 A, saM-ud-BU 1 P, pra-sU 2, 4 A, (with genitive of person); ‘I have got a pain in my teeth’ daMtapIqA me utpannA-jAtA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 Df 1 P, 10, Bf 3 U; DA 3 U; ‘I have got that book with me’ tatpustakaM matsakASe vartate; See Bear also.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 (Cause) ex. by causal; ‘g(et) it done by him’, taM tatkAraya; oft. by anunI 1 P, protsah c., pravft c.; ‘g(et) ahead’ agresarIBU; ‘g(et) clear of’ muc pass.; ‘g(et) rid of’ AtmAnaM muc c., (with abl.) by nir in comp.; ‘g(et) abroad’ prasf-prasfp 1 P, bahulIBU 1 P; See under Abroad.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] among,ⒶmaDye praviS 6 P or gam.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] at,ⒶprAp, Agam, A-yA 2 P, upasTA 1 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] away,Ⓐapasf 1 P, apa-i 2 P, apakram 1 U, 4 P; cal 1 P, apa-yA gam; ‘g(et) away, you fool’ apehi re mUrKa.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] back,ⒶpratilaB, pratyA-dA, &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] beyond,ⒶtF 1 P, ati-i, atikram.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] down,ⒶavatF, avaruh 1 P, aDo gam, ni-ava-pat 1 P; (v. t.) avatF c., avaruh c., &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] in,ⒶpraviS 6 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] into,Ⓐpat; saMkawe patitaH ‘got into troubles’; Aruh 1 P (a car &c.); ‘he got into debt’ fRagrasto baBUva; ‘g(ett)ing into deep mud’ paMkapUramAsAdya.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] off,Ⓒ(v. i.)ⒹniHsf, nirgam, apa-yA, apa-kram, nistF.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avatF, avaruh; (v. t.) niras 4 U, apa-nI 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] on,Ⓐpravft 1 A, pracal, pra-sf; ‘they long got on well’ ciraM te suKena avartaMta or kAlaM ninyuH.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] out,Ⓐnirgam, apa-i, niHsf.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 tyaj 1 P, muc 6 P; ‘g(et) out of bed now’ aDunA muMca SayyAM.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] over, [Get] through,ⒶsaMtF; pAraM-aMtaM-gam, atikram, nistF, tIr 10; Aruh.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 samAp c.; See Complete.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] together,ⒶsaMci 5 U; samA-nI, saMgrah; See Collect.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] up,Ⓐut-sTA; prabuD 4 A, SayanaM tyaj 1 P or muc; (v. t.) sajjIkf 8 U, virac 10; upakxp c.<BR>Ⓝ[Get] upon,ⒶaDi-A-ruh.<BR>Ⓝ[Get]ter,Ⓒs.ⒹprApakaH, labDf m., arjakaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Get]ting,Ⓒs.ⒹlABaH, avApti f