go
Go,Ⓒv. i.Ⓓgam 1 P, yA-i 2 P, vraj 1 P, cal-car 1 P, pad 4 A, f 1, 3 P; sf 1, 1 P; kram 1 U, 4 P; (as water) vah 1 P, sru 1 P, syaMd 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Fare) vft 1 A, sTA 1 P; ‘how g(o)es it with her’ kastasyA vfttAMtaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (As prospective future) ex. by fut. part., manaH or kAma with inf. or desid, forms; See About; ‘g(o) astray’ Bram 1, 4 P; utpaTaM yA, sanmArgAt cyu 1 A or BraMS 1 A, 4 P; utkram, ati-vyaBi-car; ‘g(o) on foot’ padByAM vraj; ‘g(o) on horse-back’ aSvena saMcar; ‘as the story g(o)es’ kila, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=186" target="_blank">Page186</a>] ‘g(o) for nothing’ (go to dogs) vi-PalIBU; ‘g(o) to bed’ SayyAM Baj-sev 1 A; ‘she is far gone in love’ dUragatamanmaTA sA (S. 3), atiBUmiM gatosyA anurAgaH; ‘g(o)-between’ maDyasTaH, maDyapuruzaH; (‘female g(o)’) SaMBalI, kuwinI; suratadUtI; ‘g(o) by’ nirgamaH, palAyanaM, vyapadeSaH; ‘g(o)-cart’ krIqASakawaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] about,Ⓐparigam-i &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 yat 1 A, udyam 1 A, vyava-so 4 P, AraB 1 A, upakram 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 anuzWA, vi-DA 3 U; See Execute.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] away,Ⓐapa-i-sf-kram-gam-yA-sfp, pra-i, sTA 1 A.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] between,ⒶmaDye sTA or vft, aMtaH-i.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] by,Ⓐati-i, samIpataH gam.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 anu-gam, anuvft, anuruD 4 A, anu-sf; ‘he g(o)es by the name of’ iti KyAtaH or jYAtaH; umAKyAM sumuKI jagAma (K. i. 26) ‘went by the name of’ &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] down,ⒶaDo gam.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 astaM gam-yA; (fig.) nASaM-kzayaM-yA; pra-lI 4 A, DvaMs 1 A.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] forth, [Go] forward,Ⓐnirgam, niHsf-kram, pra-sf, pra-sTA, pra-yA.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] in,Ⓐpra-A-viS 6 P, aMtargam-yA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (for) saMman 4 A, urI-aMgI-kf 8 U, pratipad 4 A.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] off,Ⓐapa-gam &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pra-i, sf 6 A; paralokaM yA.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] on,Ⓐpra-vft, pragam-yA-sfp.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pra-stu 2 U, prAraB 1 A; ‘g(o) on with your study’ pravartatAM-prastUyatAM-aDyayanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] out,Ⓐnirgam, niHsf, &c., bahirgam.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Of light) nirvA 2 P or c. pass. Sam 4 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] over,Ⓐvac c., aDi-i 2 A; (to oneʼs self) anuvac c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pari-Ikz 1 A.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 Akram, laMG 1 A, 10.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 anya-pakzaM saM-A-Sri 1 U; svapakzAd BraMS 1 A, 4 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] round,Ⓐpari-i gam; pradakziRIkf.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] through,ⒶanuBU, upAgam, vi-DA, anu-zWA, kf, nirvah c.; sev 1 A, Acar.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pAraM gam, samAp c.; avaso 4 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pra-nir-viS, nirBid 7 P; BittvA nirgam; vyaD 4 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] to, [Go] up to,Ⓐupa-sf-i-gam-yA, upa-sTA, pratipad &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Interj.) Dik, apehi, apasara.<BR>Ⓝ[Go] up,Ⓐud-i, utpad, UrDvaM gam.<BR>Ⓝ[Go]er,Ⓒs.ⒹgAmin-gaMtf m., caraH, yAyin m. in comp.<BR>Ⓝ[Go]ing,Ⓒs.ⒹgamanaM, yAnaM, saraRaM, calanaM, vrajanaM, gati f., ayanaM, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=185" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

