e; ‘l(ay) to a ship’ nOgatiM ruD or staMB.<BR>Ⓝ[Lay] up,Ⓐni-DA, rakz, saMci; ‘to be laid up’, SayyAgrasta a. BU 1 P, utTAtuM akzama a. BU; ‘laid up with fever’ jvareRotTAtumakzamaH.<BR>Ⓝ⒉ Lay,Ⓒs.ⒹgAnaM, gItaM, kAvyaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 AstaraH-raRaM, PalakaH-kaM.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹsAmAnya, sADAraRa (RI f.), purohitaBinna.<BR>Ⓝ[Lay]man,Ⓒs.ⒹgfhasTaH, sAmAnya-sADAraRa-janaH, adIkzitaH, prAkftaH.<BR>ⓃLaical,Ⓒa.ⒹgfhasTin, gArhasTika (kI f.), purohitaBinna, adIkzita.<BR>ⓃLaity,Ⓒs.ⒹgfhasTa-sAmAnya-janavargaH, prAkfta-sADAraRa-janAH, purohitaBinnavargaH.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170105.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=253" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

