Life,Ⓒs.ⒹjIvanaM, jIvitaM, prARaDAraRaM^1, asu-DAraRaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 jIvaH, sattvaM^2, jIvitaM, cEtanyaM [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=260" target="_blank">Page260</a>] cetanA, prARavAyuH, prARAtman m., jIvAtmA; ‘endowed with l(ife)’ jIvin, prARin, sajIva, sacetana; ‘love of l(ife)’ jIvitatfzRA, jijIvizA; ‘impatience of l(ife)’ jIvita-dvezaH-trAsaH; ‘deprived of l(ife)’ hataprARa-jIvita, nazwaprARa; ‘support of l(ife)’ prARayAtrA-DAraRaM-rakzaRaM; ‘reckless of l(ife)’ jIvitavyayin, jIvitanirapekza; ‘means of l(ife)’ jIvanopAyaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Life-time) Ayus n., jIvitaM, jI-vanaM, jIvitakAlaH, AyurmaryAdA, AyuHpari-mARaM; ‘possessed of long l(ife)’ dIrGAyus, Ayuzmat, cirAyus; ‘for l(ife)’, ‘during l(ife)’ ‘all oneʼs l(ife)’ yAvajjIvaM, AmaraRAt; ‘in all oneʼs l(ife)’ Ajanma, janmataH praBfti or AraBya; ‘my lamp of l(ife) is nearly out’ nirvARaBUyizWo me jIvitapradIpaH or avasita-prAyo me jIvitAvaDiH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 (fig.) jIvitaM, prARAH, (tvaM jIvitaM me U. 3).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 saMsAraH, BavaH, saMsfti f., lokayAtrA, BUlokavAsaH, ihavAsaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 vftti f., AcAraH, vyavahAraH, rIti f., cezwitaM, pravfttiH, vfttaM, AcaraRaM; ‘leading a virtuous l(ife)’ sADuvftta, sadAcAra, puRyamArga.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 caritaM, caritraM, jIvanavfttAMtaH, caritraracanA-kaTanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		8 avasTA, daSA, sTiti f., vfttiH, BAvaH, gati f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		9 utsAhaH, vIryaM, tejas n., sattvaM^3, rasaH; ‘bring or restore to l(ife)’ ujjIv c., socCvAsa a. kf 8 U, asUn prAp c., (parIkzitaM durlaBAnasUnprApita-vAn Ka. 175); ‘come to l(ife)’ ujjIv 1 P; ‘active l(ife)’ pravfttiH, pravftti-saMsAra-mArgaH, lokavyavahAraH; ‘retired l(ife)’ nivfttiH, ni-vfttimArgaH; ‘he entered on a military l(ife)’ yoDavfttimASrayata; ‘engaging in public l(ife)’ lokavyavahArapravfttiH; ‘in this l(ife)’ iha, ihaloke; ‘the vicissitudes of l(ife)’ saMsAra-cakraM-parivartanaM, daSAMtarARi; ‘l(ife)-blood’ prARaH, tattvaM, sAraBUtaM dravyaM; ‘l(ife)-giving’ prARada, jIva-da-dAyin; vIryada, utsAhakara (rI f.); ‘l(ife)-guard’ rAjaparicaraH, SarIra-rakzakaH; ‘l(ife)-time’ jIvitAvaDiH, jIvita-kAlaH; ‘during oneʼs l(ife)-time’ yAvajjIvaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Life]less,Ⓒa.ⒹgatajIvita, gatAsu, parAMsu, vyasu, gata-nazwa-prARa, hatajIvita, prARa or jIva-rahita or hIna, acezwa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ajIva, nirjIva, vi-a-cetana, cEtanya-hIna-rahita, niScetana.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 niHsattva, nirutsAha, nistejas, sattva-rasa-hIna.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170120. note: Print vague. cf mwe - mw.<BR>[2] Correction submitted by  on 20160906.<BR>[3] Correction submitted by  on 20160906.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=259" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lift
Lift,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓunnam c. (namayati), udgam c. (gamayati), ucCri 1 U, udyam 1 A, utTA c. (utTApayati), utkzip 6 P, udDf 1 P, unnI 1 P, utkfz 1 P, uttul 10; oft. by ut in comp.; ‘with the neck l(ift)ed up’ utkaM-DaraH; udbAhuH, udgrIvaH^1, unmuKaH, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (In rank) utkfzwapade niyuj 7 A, 10, mAnaM saMvfD c., pratipattiM-pratizWAM-utkarzaM-pada-vfdDiM-laB c. (laMBayati); ‘l(ift) with pride’ dfp c., garveRa udDan 2 P, darpeRa A-DmA 1 P; ‘to l(ift) up the voice’ tArasvareRa-uccEH-A-kruS 1 P.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹunnamanaM, ucCrayaH, utkarzaH, utTApanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pratipatti f., padavfdDi f., unnati f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 upakAraH, sAhAyyaM.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170829.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=260" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

