light
⒈ Light,Ⓒa.ⒹlaGu (in all senses); aguru, alpa-BAra, alpapramARa, laGuBAra, laGupramARa; suvAhya, suKavAhya, susahya, adurvaha, aduHsaha.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 suKa, sukara, akazwa, susADya, sugama, nirA-yAsa, avizama, akaWina.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 capala, laGu, laGuSarIra-gati.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 sollAsa, praPulla, niSciMta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 capala, caMcala, lola, tarala, asTira, anava-sTita, laGucitta-svaBAva-cetas, gAMBIryahIna, nirgOrava.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 tucCa, kzudra, atyalpa, tfRaprAya, laGvarTa, alpArTa, alpa-laGu-praBAva; ‘l(ight) armed’ laGvAyuDa, laGuSastraBft; ‘l(ight)-fingered’ laGuhasta, capalapARi; ‘l(ight)-footed’ laGu-SIGra-gati, drutagati^1; ‘l(ight)-headed’ laGu-citta-cetas, capala-lola-mati; BrAMta or vikzipta-budDi or citta; budDiBramAt pralApin; ‘l(ight)-headedness’ citta or budDi-BramaH or viplavaH; ‘l(ight)-hearted’ laGucitta-cetas, kzudramanas; hfzwa-prasanna-hfdaya, ullAsin, praPullacitta, AnaMdita, sollAsa; ‘l(ight)-minded’ laGu-ce-tas-citta, kzudra or kfpaRa-budDi or mati; ‘l(ight) spirited’ hfzwahfdaya-citta, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 pAMqu, Sveta; oft. ex. by A, Izat; ‘l(ight) red’ SvetAruRa, Izadrakta; ‘l(ight) blue’ SvetanIla, AnIla; ‘l(ight) food’ supacaM-supAkaM-annaM; ‘to make l(ight) of’ laGUkf 8 U, laGu man 4 A, na gaR 10, tfRAya man.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹA-pat P; (akasmAt) Asad c., prAp 5 P, A-upA-gam 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 avatF 1 P, avaruh 1 P, ava-ni-pat; aDyAs 2 A, aDi-SI 2 A (with acc.), nizad 1 P, ni-lI 4 A.<BR>Ⓝ⒈ [Light]en,Ⓒv. t.ⒹlaGUkf, laGayati (D.); Sam c. (Samayati), pra-upa°.<BR>Ⓝ⒈ [Light]er,Ⓒa.ⒹlaGutara, laGIyas.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹtarAluH, vahitraM, uqupaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Light]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹlaGu, lAGavena, alpapramARena.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 suKena, akazwena, anAyAsena.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 nizkAraRaM, hetuM vinA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 laGugatyA, capalaM, satvaraM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 laGucetasA, caMcalavat, asTiratayA; ‘to think l(ight)’ laGu man 4 A.<BR>Ⓝ[Light]ness,Ⓒs.Ⓓ(lit.) laGutA-tvaM, lAGavaM, alpaBAratvaM, BArABAva.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 suKaM, sOkaryaM, anAyAsaH, susADyatA, akazwatvaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 suvAhyatA, susahyatA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 lAGavaM, cApalyaM, drutagatitvaM, SarIralaGutA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 cApalyaM, cAMcalyaM, asTiratA, lolatA, capalatA, agOravaM, laGiman, lAGavaM, laGutA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 laGutA, tucCatA, kzudratA.<BR>Ⓝ⒈ [Light]some,Ⓒa.Ⓓhfzwa, sollAsa, praPulla, vItaciMta, sAnaMda.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20161211.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=260" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light
⒉ Light,Ⓒs.ⒹprakASaH, AlokaH, BA, praBA, ABA, dyuti f., kAMti f., dIpti f., tejas n., jyoti-s n., ruci f., BAs f., tviz f.; varcas n.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pra-, dIpaH, dIpikA; ‘l(ight)-house’ dIpagfhaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 jYAnaM, boDaH, avagamaH, prakASaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 prasidDi f., praKyAti f., prAkASyaM, prakASatA, prAkawyaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 dfzwi f.; ‘See or come to l(ight)’ prasidDiM-prakASatAM-gam 1 P, prakASI BU 1 P, AvirBU, prAdurBU; ‘bring to l(ight)’ prakAS c., prakawIkf 8 U, spazwIkf, Avizkf, vi-vf 5 U, praKyA c. (KyApayati); ‘to throw l(ight) on’, viSadI-kf, vivf, prakAS c.; See Explain; ‘from the l(ight) of utility’ upayogadfzwyA; ‘considered in this l(ight)’ anayA dfzwyA.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹdIp c., ut-pra-saM°; pra-, dyut c., prakAS c., ava-vi-BAs c., jval c., pra-ut-saM-°; saM-, iMD 7 A; saMDukz 10; tap c., pra-saM-ut°; ‘to be l(ight)ed’ dIp 4 A, jval 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ⒉ [Light]en,Ⓒv. t.ⒹprakAS c., dIp c., jval c., dyut c., See (v. t.) above.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹsPur 6 P, dyut 1 A, prakAS 1 A, vilas 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ⒉ [Light]er,Ⓒs.ⒹprakASakaH, dyotakaH, dIpakaH, dyutidaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Light]less,Ⓒa.ⒹnizpraBa, apraBa, nirAloka, nistejas.<BR>Ⓝ⒉ [Light]some,Ⓒa.ⒹdIptimat, prakASavat, supraBa, tejasvin, suprakASa, tejomaya (yI f.).<BR>Ⓝ[Light]ning,Ⓒs.Ⓓtaqit, vidyut, sOdAmi(ma)nI, acirapraBA, kzaRadA, caMcalA, capalA, SatahradA, hrAdinI, SaMpA, ErAvatI, kzaRa-praBA-dyuti (all f.); ‘fire of l(ightning)’ vEdyutaH agniH; ‘forked l(ightning)’ taqillatA, vidyullatA; ‘the falling of l(ightning)’ vidyutpAtaH; ‘struck by l(ightning)’ vidyutA upahata.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=261" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

