loose
Loose,Ⓒa.ⒹSiTila, pra-, SlaTa, srasta, vigalita, calita, mukta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 abadDa, udgraTita, utsUtra, baMDanarahita-SUnya, uddAma, pramukta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 virala, asaMhata, adfQasaMDi.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 avyavasTita, aniyata, anirRIta, saMdigDa, asaMkzipta; asTira.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 asaMbadDa, niHsaMga, niranvaya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 ucCfMKala, nirmaryAda; anavasTa, durvftta, vyaBicArin, vyasanin, durAcAra.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 garhya, niMdya, aSlIla; ‘l(oose) conduct’ durAcAraH; vyasanaM, nItiBraMSaH, ‘a l(oose) man’ laMpawaH, vyasanin m. ‘a l(oose) woman’ baMDakI, puMScalI, BrazwA; ‘let l(oose)’ muc 6 P; See (v.); ‘break l(oose)’ baMDanaM Bid or Cid 7 P, baMDanAt BraMS 1 A, 4 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Loos]en,Ⓒv. t.ⒹSiTilayati (D.), SiTilIkf 8 U, Sra(SraM)T-SlaT 1 P, 10 (SlaTayati), sraMs c., SlaTIkf.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 muc 6 P or c., vi-nir-ut°; mokz 10, visfj 6 P or c., baMDanAt muc.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 ud-graMT 9 P, ud-ava-muc, viyuj 7 A, 10, viSliz c., visaM-DA 3 U.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹSiTilIBU 1 P, Sla(Sra)T 1 A, sraMs 1 A, gal 1 P, SiTilAyate (D.).<BR>Ⓝ[Loose]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹSiTilaM, SlaTaM, adfQaM, viralaM, asaMhataM, aniyataM; durvfttavat, nirmaryAdaM; ‘l(oosely) hanging matted hair’ SlaTalaMbinyaH jawAH; ‘hanging l(oosely)’ srasta.<BR>Ⓝ[Loos]ing, [Loos]ening,Ⓒs.ⒹSiTilIkaraRaM, mocanaM, mokzaRaM, mukti f., SraMTanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Loose]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹSETilyaM, pra-, SlaTaH, sraMsaH, SlaTatA, srastatA, adfQatA, aniyatatA, viralatA, vyasanitA, durAcAraH, anavasTA, lAMpawyaM, vyaBicAraH; See Laxity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=268" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

