lord
Lord,Ⓒs.ⒹISaH, praBuH, ISvaraH, svAmin m., aDipaH, patiH, ISitf m., aDiBUH, nAyakaH, netf m., Bartf m., nATaH, iMdraH in comp.; rAjan m. parivfQaH, iByaH, Danin m. AQyaH; ‘to be l(ord) of’ pra-BU 1 P, IS 2 A, (with gen.); See Master; ‘supreme l(ord)’ sarveSvaraH, aDirAjaH, nareMdraH, kzitipatiH, svargADipaH, jaga-nnATaH-nAyakaH, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Title of address) devaH, mahArAjaH, svAmin m., AryaputraH (by wives) Bartf m. (by servants &c.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 parameSvaraH, BagavAn, praBuH, ISvaraH.<BR>Ⓔv. i.Ⓓ(sadarpaM-saDarzaM) IS or SAs 2 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Lord]like, [Lord]ly,Ⓒa.ⒹrAjo-cita, praBuyogya; rAjasadfSa (SI f.), rAjArha, ISvarIya, ESvara (rI f.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ojasvin, dIptimat, tejasvin; See Majestic.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 Dfzwa, avalipta, ESvaryamatta, dfpta, garvita, utsikta; See Haughty.<BR>Ⓔadv.ⒹsaDarzaM, sadarpaM, u-dDataM, ESvaryamadena.<BR>Ⓝ[Lord]ship,Ⓒs.ⒹdevaH, &c.; See above; ‘his l(ordship)’ tatraBavAn; mahArAjaH; ‘your l(ordship)’ atraBavAn, devaH, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 praButvaM, svAmitvaM, ESvaryaM, aDikAraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 rAjyaM, vizayaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=268" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

