matter
Matter,Ⓒs.ⒹdravyaM, vastu n., sTUla or Gana-dravyaM or vastu, BOtikavastu, sAkAradravyaM, mUrti f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sADanaM, prakfti f., upakaraRaM, kAraRaM, upAdAnaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 dravyaM, vastu, padArTaH; arTaH, vizayaH, prakaraRaM; padaM, AspadaM, prastAvaH, prasaMgaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 prayojanaM, hetuH, kAraRaM, kAryaM, vyApAraH, arTaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 sAraH, tattvaM, arTaH, gurutvaM, gOravaM, mahattvaM, praBAvaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 pUyaM, dUzyaM, kzatajaM, pUyaraktaM-SoRitaM; ‘m(atter) in hand’ prakftaM, prastutaM; ‘m(atter) of dispute’ vivAdavastu-vizayaH-AspadaM &c.; ‘it is of no m(atter)’ yatkiMcitkarametat, nirarTakaM; sUkzmavicArasyA-vizayaH; ‘an important m(atter)’ gurvarTaH; ‘of no m(atter)’ nirarTaka, niHsAra, aguru; ‘what is the m(atter) with her’ kiM tasyA vfttaM, kastasyA vfttAMtaH.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹEx. by arTaH, or by kiM, kAryaM with instr.; ‘what m(atter)s it to me’ kiM mama tena kAryaM, korTaH &c.; ‘it m(atter)s very little’, ‘it m(atter)s not’ laGvarTametat, nAyaM garIyAnarTaH,<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pUyapUrRa a. BU 1 P, pUyaM utpad c.<BR>Ⓝ[Matter]y,Ⓒa.ⒹpUyapUrRa-yukta-garBa, sapUya.<BR>ⓃMaterial,Ⓒa.ⒹBUtAtmaka, BOtika (kI f.), BUtamaya (yI f.), ADi-pAMca-BOtika, mUrta, dravyamaya, prAkftika (kI f.); Gana, sTUla, jaqa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 apAramArTika (kI f.), anAtmIya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 sAravat, sasAra, vAstavika (kI f.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 guru, mahat, paramArTa, gurvarTa; AvaSyaka (kI f.), muKya, praDAna, viSizwa; See Principal; ‘m(aterial) world’ BUtasfzwi f., sTUlaM jagat; ‘m(aterial) body’ sTUla-jaqa-dehaH; BOtikapiMqaH; ‘m(aterial) cause’ prakftiH, upAdAnaM, upAdAnakAraRaM; ‘proximity being not m(aterial)’ sanniDAnasya akiMcitkaratvAt (S. B. 141).<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹsADanaM, upakaraRaM, dravyaM, kAraRaM, upAdAnaM, prakftiH, padArTaH, sADanavastu; ‘all m(aterial)s’ sAmagrI, sajjA, saMBAraH, dravya or upakaraRa-sAmagrI or saMBAraH; ‘writing m(aterial)s’ lipi-sajjA, leKanasADanAni; ‘the m(aterial) of cloth’ vastrayoniH-prakftiH.<BR>Ⓝ[Material]ism,Ⓒs.ⒹlokA-yataM, anAtmavAdaH, cArvAkamataM.<BR>Ⓝ[Material]ist,Ⓒs.Ⓓlo-kAyatikaH, anAtmavAdin m.; vizayin m.<BR>Ⓝ[Material]ity,Ⓒs.ⒹBOtikatvaM, mUrtimattvaM, &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Material]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹarTataH, vastutaH, tattvataH, paramArTataH, sArataH, prakftitaH, prakftyEva.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=281" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

