mature
Mature,Ⓒa.Ⓓpakva, su-pari-pakva, pariRata, pakvatA-mApanna, pAkonmuKa (KI f.), PalonmuKa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMpanna, saM-pari-pUrRa, prOQa, sidDa; ‘m(ature) deliberation’ suvicAraH, prasamIkzya-suvimfSya-vicAraH, susamIkzA, suvimarSaH.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹparipAkaM nI 1 P, pari-Ram c. (Ramayati), pakvatAM-pAkaM-utpad c., pac c.; saM-pad c., sAD c., sidDIkf 8 U, kaWorIkf; kalAkalApAlocanakaWora-matiBiH (Ka. 7) ‘whose mind was m(atur)ed by studying &c.’<BR>Ⓔv. i.Ⓓpac pass., pariRam 1 P, pAkaM-pariRAmaM-i or yA 2 P or gam 1 P; kaWorI-prOQI-BU 1 P; pariRataprajYasya kavervARIM (U. 7) ‘of m(atur)ed intellect’.<BR>Ⓝ[Matur]ate,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓpac c., pari-Ram c.<BR>Ⓔv. i.Ⓓpac pass., pakvIBU, pUyapUrRa a. BU.<BR>Ⓝ[Matur]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹpAkaH, vipari°, pariRati f., pariRAmaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sapUyatvaM, pUyasrAvaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Matur]ative,Ⓒa.ⒹpAkala, pA-cana, pacizRu, pUyajanana (nI f.).<BR>Ⓝ[Matur]ity, [Mature]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹpAkaH, vi-pari-°, pariRAmaH, vipakvatA, pariRati f., prOQa-pakva-daSA, pakva-pariRata-avasTA, pakvaBAvaH, kaWoratA, prOQatA, sidDi f., saMpUrRatA.<BR>Ⓝ[Mature]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹsapariRAmaM, sapAkaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 susamIkzya, suvimfSya, suvicArya, samyagavaDArya.<BR>ⓃMaturescent,Ⓒa.ⒹApakva, pariRAmonmuKa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=281" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

