measure
Measure,Ⓒv. t.ⒹmA 3 A, 2 P, pra-pari-°; tul 10, mAnaM nirUp 10 or jYA 9 U.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 gaR 10.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 viBaj 1 U, pari-kxp c.; See Divide.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 laMG 1 A, 10, atikram 1 U, 4 P, ati i 2 P.<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹEx. by pra-pari-mARa, mAtra, mita, parimita in comp.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹmAnaM, pra-pari-mARaM, (fig. also); ‘m(easur)ing rod’ mAnadaMqaH; ‘m(easure) of capacity’ pratImAnaM, prasTaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-, BAgaH, aMSaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pramARaM, paryaMtaH, mAtrA, maryAdA, sImA; ‘in some m(ean)’ Izat, kiMcit, alpamAtraM; ‘beyond m(ean)’ atimAtraM, nitAMtaM, atIva, BfSaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 upAyaH, prayogaH, sADanaM, yukti f., pravftti f., kriyA, upacAraH; ‘take m(easure)s’ upAyaM prayuj 7 A, 10 or ASri 1 U or avalaMb 1 A, kArye pravft 1 A; ‘mild m(ean)’ sAman n., sAmopAyaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 CaMdas n., vfttaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 tAlaH, layaH; ‘the steps are in m(ean)’ pAda-nyAso layamanugataH (M. 2); ‘the m(easure) of a vowel’ mAtrA; ‘in musical m(ean)’ svarabadDa a.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 apavartaH; ‘having a common m(ean)’ sApavarta.<BR>Ⓝ[Measur]ed,Ⓒa.Ⓓmita, parimita; niyata, nibadDa; See Limited.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sama, samAna, DIra.<BR>Ⓝ[Measur]er,Ⓒs.ⒹmApakaH, mAnanirUpakaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Measure]less,Ⓒa.Ⓓamita, aparimARa.<BR>Ⓝ[Measure]ment,Ⓒs.ⒹmApanaM, mAnaM, pra-pari-mARaM, pra-pari-miti f.; ‘rough m(easurement)’ sTUlamAnaM; ‘accurate m(easurement)’ sUkzmamAnaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=283" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

