obscure
Obscure,Ⓒa.Ⓓtamovfta, sAMDakAra, nizpraBa, malina, satimira, nistejas, tamasvin.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 aprasidDa, nAtiviSruta, avijYAta, aKyAta, alpakIrti, laGupratizWa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 ni-, gUQa, durboDa, klizwa, durjYeya, gahana, durgama, vizama, aprakASa, aspazwa, asPuwa, gUQArTa, avyakta.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓ(tamasA) pra-A-cCad 10, Avf 5 U, uparuD 7 U, aMtarayati (D.), malinI-timirI-kf 8 U, malinayati-timirayati- (D.), praBAM-tejaH-hf 1 P or kzi 1, 5 P; ‘o(bscure) with clouds’ meGEH AcCad or Avf.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 gahanIkf, gUQIkf; ex. by (a.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Fig.) pratyA-diS 6 P, pratyAKyA 2 P, pracCad; See Eclipse. ‘o(bscur)er of Śri’ pratyAdeSaH SriyaH (V. 1).<BR>Ⓝ[Obscur]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹmalinIkaraRaM, kAMti-praBA-haraRaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 tejaH or praBA-kzayaH or hAni f., nizpraBatA, sAMDakAratA.<BR>Ⓝ[Obscur]ed,Ⓒa.Ⓓtamovfta, nazwa-kzIRa-malina-kzata-praBa-kAMti-prakASa, malina, nistejas, hatajyotis.<BR>Ⓝ[Obscur]ity, [Obscure]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹnizpraBatA, tejaH or kAMti-kzayaH or hAniH, tamas n., tamisraM, aMDa-kAraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 gUQatA, gahanatA, asPuwatA, durboDatA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 aprasidDi-aviKyAti f., alpapratizWA-kIrti f.<BR>Ⓝ[Obscure]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹnizpraBaM, satimiraM, sAMDakAraM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 gUQaM, durboDaM, asugamaM, aspazwaM, avyaktaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=313" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

