part
Part,Ⓒs.Ⓓvi-, BAgaH, aMSaH, KaMqaH-qaM, SakalaH-laM, lavaH, vi-, dalaM, BinnaM, kalA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pra-, deSaH, eka-deSaH, avayavaH, aMgaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Allotted) vi-, BAgaH, aMSaH, udDAraH, vaMwaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 karman n., kAryaM, niyogaH, DarmaH, svakartavyaM-DarmaH; ‘perform oneʼs p(art)’ karma nirvah c., niyogamanuzWA 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 BUmikA; pAtraM; ‘assignment of p(art)s’ BUmikAkalpanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 aMgaM, avayavaH, GawakaH, Gawa-kAvayavaH; ‘consisting of 4 p(art)s’ caturaMgaM (balaM).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 vAraH, paryAyaH; See Turn.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		8 pakzaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		9 saMbaMDaH, anuzaMgaH; ‘to have a p(art) in’ saMbaMD-anuzaMj- pass.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		10 (‘P(art)s’) mati f., matiguRaH, budDi f., DISakti f.; See Intellect; (region) pra-, deSaH; ‘for (on) oneʼs p(art)’ tAvat, api; ‘for the most p(art)’, prAyaH, bahuSaH, prAyaSaH, prAyeRa, BUyizWaM; See Mostly, ‘by p(art)s’, ‘in p(art)s’ BAgaSaH, aMSaSaH; ‘in p(art)’ aMSataH, Izat, kiMcit; ‘in good p(art)’ saMprItamanasA, priyaM, anukUlaM, prasannaM; prasannamanasA; ‘in ill-p(art)’ ruzwa-Kinna-manasA; ‘in four p(art)s’ caturDA; ‘in many p(art)s’ bahuDA.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹviBaj 1 U, pari-kxp c., viBAgaSaH vinyas 4 U, vaMw 10; See Divide.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-yuj 7 A, 10, viSliz c. pfTak kf 8 U, viBid 7 P or c., vicCid 7 P; (the hair) sImaMtayati (D.).<BR>Ⓔv. i.Ⓓviyuj-viBid-vicCid- pass., vigam 1 P. viSliz 4 P, apa-yA 2 P, apagam.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vi-, dal 1 P, sPuw 6 P, vi-dF pass., SakalIBU.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 (With) A-maMtr 10 A, ApracC 6 A; tyaj 1 P, kzip 6 P (place); ‘let me now p(art) with you’ anujAnIhi mAmaDunA gama-nAya.<BR>Ⓝ[Part]ing,Ⓒa.ⒹprAsTAnika (kI f.), prasTAna-prayARa in comp.; ‘p(arting) ceremony’ prasTAnakOtukaM.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹviyogaH, viSlezaH, virahaH, viBedaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-apa-gamaH, prasTAnaM, prayARaM, apa-yAnaM; ‘p(arting) of the hair’ sImaMtaH, sImaMta-racanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Part]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹaMSataH, BAgataH, kiMcit, Izat, stokaM, kiyat, alpaM, stokAMSena, KaMqataH.<BR>ⓃPartake,Ⓒv.ⒹaMSaBAj a. BU 1 P, aMSaM-BAgaM-grah 9 U or hf 1 P, Baj 1 A, aMSaM Baj, BAgin a. BU; See Share.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 Buj 7 A, sev 1 A.<BR>Ⓝ[Partak]er,Ⓒs.ⒹaMSin m., BAgI, aMSa-BAga-grAhI-hArI-haraH, saha-BAk-Bogin, Buj-BAj in comp.<BR>ⓃPartial,Ⓒa.ⒹavyApaka, asArvatrika-AMSika (kI f.). asamagra, asaMpUrRa, asakala, ekadeSa-KaMqa- in comp.; ‘p(artial) eclipse’ KaMqagrAsaH; ‘p(artial) rent’ ekadeSacCidraM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pakzapAtin, pakzasnehin, pakzAnukUla, pakzAnurAgin, ekadeSIya, sapakza-pAta, saMgin, asamadfzwi, asamadarSin.<BR>Ⓝ[Partial]ity,Ⓒs.ⒹpakzapAtaH, pakzapAtitA, pakzasnehaH-AnukUlyaM-anurAgaH, asamatA, asamadfzwi f. -budDi f., saMgaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 snehaH, anurAgaH, praRayaH, preman m. n.; ‘speak without any p(artiality)’ maDyasTatAM gfhItvA BaRa (M. 3).<BR>Ⓝ[Partial]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹaMSataH, asamagraM, asakalaM, asaMpUrRaM, kvacit kvacit; asarvatra, KaMqataH, ekadeSe, Izat, stokaM, KaMqa-ekadeSa in comp.; ‘p(artially) broken’ KaMqaBagna; See Partly.<BR>ⓃParticipate,Ⓒv. t.ⒹBAgaM-aMSaM-grah 9 U, saMviBaj 1 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Participat]ion,Ⓒs.ⒹaMSa-BAga-grahaRaM, saMviBAgaH, sahaBogaH-Bukti f.<BR>ⓃParticipant,Ⓒa., s.ⒹBAgin, aMSin; See Partaker.<BR>ⓃParticle,Ⓒs.ⒹkaRaH, aRuH, lavaH, kzudrAMSaH, kaRikA, leSaH, kalA, paramARuH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nipAtaH, avyayaH-yaM.<BR>ⓃPartition,Ⓒs.ⒹparicCedaH, viyojanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-, BAgaH, viBAgakalpanaM-nA, viBajanaM, vaMwanaM, vyaMSanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vyavacCedanaM, Bitti f., vyavaDA-DAnaM, kozWaH, saMDiH.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹvicCid 7 P, viBaj 1 U, aMSAMSi dA 3 U; See (v. t.).<BR>ⓃPartner,Ⓒs.ⒹaMSin m., BAgI, samAMSI, sahaBogI-BAgI; saMgI, sahAyaH, sahakArI, saMBUyakArI, saMsargI, anuzaMgI; ‘p(artner) of joys and sorrows’ samaduHKasuKaH (S. 3).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 Husband, Wife, q. v.<BR>Ⓝ[Partner]ship,Ⓒs.ⒹsahakAritA, saMBUyakAritvaM, samAMSitA, saMBUyasamutTAnaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=331" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

