particular
Particular,Ⓒa.ⒹviSizwa, sviSeza, viSezaka, ava-pari-cCedaka, viSeza in comp.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vyakta, viBinna, vivikta, uddizwa, pfTagAtmaka, amuka in comp.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 avyApaka, anOtsargika (kI f.); viSizwa, not General q. v.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 asADAraRa (RI f.), asAmAnya, lokottara, aprAkfta (tI f.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 vilakzaRa, apUrva.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 sUkzma, sUkzma-dfzwi, sUkzmadarSin, ‘at a p(articular) time’ viSizwa-samaye, samayaviSeze; ‘a p(articular) rule’ viSeza-viDiH; ‘he is very p(articular) about his dress’ vezakriyAyAM so'tIva sUkzmadfzwiH.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹviSezaH, ava-pari-cCedaH; ‘give p(articular)s of the man’ tasya narasya viSezaM brUhi; ‘he told all the p(articular)s of the battle’ yudDaM sa vistareRa avarRayat, aKilaM yudDavfttAMtaM akaTayat; ‘in p(articular)’ viSe-zataH, viSezeRa.<BR>Ⓝ[Particular]ity,Ⓒs.ⒹviSezanirdeSaH kaTanaM, ekEkaSaH nirdeSaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 asAmAnyatA, avyApakatvaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pArTakyaM, BinnatA, vyakti f., viSizwatA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 vivaraRaM, vistaraH.<BR>Ⓝ[Particular]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹviSezataH, savi-SezaM, praDAnataH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vistareRa, savistaraM; sUkzma-tayA, atisUkzmaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pfTak, avayavaSaH, ekEkaSaH.<BR>ⓃParticularize,Ⓒv. t.ⒹviSiz 7 P, ekE-kaSaH nirdiS 6 P or aBi-DA 3 U, savi-SezaM varR 10 or kaT 10, vyavacCid 7 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Particulariz]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹviSezavarRanaM-nA, viSeza-nirdeSaH-kaTanaM, vyavacCedaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Particulariz]ed,Ⓒa.ⒹviSezita, ekEka-SaH nirdizwa, vyavacCinna.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

