party
Party,Ⓒs.ⒹpakzaH; ‘oneʼs own p(arty)’ sva-Atma-pakzaH; ‘of oneʼs p(arty)’ svapakzAvalaMbin, svapakzapAtin; ‘of the opposite p(arty)’ vi-prati-pakzaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMsargaH, sapakzARAM gaRaH-saMGaH, kftasaMsargA janAH, SAKA, pakzaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 gaRaH, samUhaH, dalaM, saMGaH, vfMdaM, maMqalaM, gulmaH-lmaM, paMkti f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 arTin m., pratyarTI, vAdI, prativAdI.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 saBA, samAjaH, paMktiH f., gaRaH; ‘dinner (convivial) p(arty)’ sagDi f., saha-saM-BojanaM; sapIti f., tulyapAnaM (‘drinking p(arty)’).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 viSizwajanaH, vyakti f., vivakzita-puruzaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 saMbaMDin m., anuzaMgI, BAgI, aMSI, sahakArI, sahAyaH; ‘a p(arty) to a plot’ kUwa-sahAyaH.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹpAkzika (kI f.), pakza in comp. by (s.); ‘p(arty)-coloured’ citravicitra, nAnAvarRa-raMga, vicitra; ‘p(arty)-man’ pakzapAtin m. pAkzikaH; ‘p(arty)-spirit’ pakzapAtaH; See Partiality; ‘p(arty)-wall’ Bitti f., saMDiH; kuqyaM.<BR>ⓃPartisan,Ⓒs.ⒹpakzapAtI, pakzAvalaMbI, pakzyaH, ekapakzaH, sapakzaH, sahotTAyI, anu-, saMgI, pArSva(rSvi)kaH, pakzaDaraH.<BR>Ⓝ[Partisan]ship,Ⓒs.ⒹpakzapAtaH-grahaRaM-avalaMbanaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

