Ready,Ⓒa.Ⓓsajja, sidDa, upakxpta, sajjIBUta-kfta, Ayojita, upasTita; sannadDa; upa-pari-kalpita; ‘to get r(eady)’ sajjIkf 8 U, upa-pari-kxp c., upasTA c., (sabARAsanaM raTamupasTApaya S. 2), sannah 4 P or c.; See Prepare; ‘to be r(eady)’ sajjIBU; (food) sidDa, saMskfta, nizpanna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Of persons) udyata, sidDa, sajja, sannadDa, udyukta, unmuKa, aBimuKa; oft. by desid.; kUlaM pipatizati ‘is r(eady) to drop down’; ‘r(eady) to go’ gaMtumudyata, gamanodyata, gamanonmuKa; ‘stands r(eady) to burst forth’ BedonmuKaM tizWati (V. 2).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 pratyutpanna, tIkzRa, kuSAgra, sUkzma, samayopayukta, kAlocita.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 SIGra, tvarita, druta, avilaMbita, kzipra; kuSala, nipuRa, dakza, pawu, laGu.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 sukara, sugama, suKa, anAyAsin.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 utsuka, icCu, sakAma, oft. ex. by manaH or kAma with inf.; ‘r(eady) at hand’ upa-sTita, hastagata, nikawavartin; ‘having r(eady) wit’, ‘r(eady)-witted’ pratyutpannamati-DI-budDi, vidagDa.<BR>Ⓝ[Read]ily,Ⓒadv.ⒹkAmaM, kAmataH, prakAmaM, icCApUrvaM, sotsAhaM, sotsukaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 Jawiti, SIGraM, sapadi, acirAt, ASu, avilaMbitaM; See Quickly.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 suKena, anAyAsena, suKaM, ayatnena, akleSena, suKa in comp.<BR>Ⓝ[Read]iness,Ⓒs.ⒹsidDatA, sajjatA, sidDi f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sakAmatvaM, icCA, OtsukyaM, utsAhaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 avilaMbaH, SIGratA, tIkzRatA, sUkzmatA, pratyutpannatA; dakzatA, &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

real
Real,Ⓒa.Ⓓsatya, avitaTa, vAstavika-tAtvika- (kI f.), akftrima, paramArTa, yaTArTa, taTya, akalpita, akapawa, anvarTa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Property) sTAvara; ‘to take to be r(eal)’ paramArTena grah 9 U; See Earnest.<BR>Ⓝ[Real]ity,Ⓒs.ⒹsatyatA, yATArTyaM, satyaM, taTyaM, tattvaM; ‘un-r(eality)’ mi-TyAtvaM, asAratA-tvaM, niHsAratA; ‘a r(eality)’ satyaM, tattvaM, vastu n., ‘in r(eality)’ vastutaH, tattvataH, paramArTataH.<BR>Ⓝ[Real]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹvastutaH, paramArTataH, tattvataH, yaTArTaM, satyameva, nUnaM, Kalu; ‘r(eally) speaking’ vastuvfttena, paramArTadfzwyA, tattvataH, vastutaH.<BR>ⓃRealize,Ⓒv. t.ⒹsAD c.; pari-, pUr 10, saMpad c.; See Get.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 pratyakzIkf 8 U, satyAkf, pratyakzaM anuBU 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Realiz]ation,Ⓒs.ⒹsADanaM, sidDi f., nizpatti f., saMpAdanaM, pUraRaM, pratyakzIkaraRaM; ‘r(ealization) of an object’ kftArTatA, izwasidDiH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

