Resist,Ⓒv. t.ⒹpratibaMD 9 P, prati-vi-ruD 7 U, ni-, vAr 10, pratyavasTA 1 A; pratikf 8 U, pratyA-vyA-han 2 P; bAD 1 A, nigrah 9 P, pratizwaMB 9 P, paripaMTIBU; See Oppose.<BR>Ⓝ[Resist]ance,Ⓒs.Ⓓprati-vi-roDaH, pratibaMDaH, prati(tI)kAraH, pratiyogaH, paryavasTAnaM, pratizwaMBaH, pratiyatnaH, pratyAGAtaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Resist]er,Ⓒs.Ⓓpratiyogin m., pratibaMDakaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Resist]less,Ⓒa.ⒹanivArya, durnivAra, apratikAra, anavagraha, durnigraha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

resolve
Resolve,Ⓒv. i.ⒹniSci 5 U, nirRI 1 P, vyava-so 4 P, aDyava-so, saMkxp c., matiM-budDiM-kf 8 U; See Determine.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓvi-lI c., vi-dru c. (melt); gal c., kzar c.; sAgare nadyo vilIyaMte ‘rivers are r(esolv)ed into the sea’<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-yuj 7 A, 10, viSliz c., vyAkf, viBid c., pfTak kf; See Separate,<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Doubts) Cid 7 P, apAkf, apanI 1 P, niras 4 U; See Dispel.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹResolution, q. v.<BR>Ⓝ[Resolv]ed,Ⓒa.ⒹviSlezita, vyAkfta, &c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 kftaniScaya-saMkalpa-mati-budDi, vyavasita, niScita, nirRIta, saMkalpita.<BR>Ⓝ[Resolv]ent,Ⓒs.ⒹdrAvaRaM, SoTahft.<BR>Ⓝ[Resolv]er,Ⓒs.ⒹviBetf m., CettA, Cid m., in comp.<BR>ⓃResolute,Ⓒa.ⒹdfQa or sTira or niScaya-saMkalpa, sTiraDI mati, DIra, Dftimat; See Resolved also.<BR>Ⓝ[Resolute]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹdfQaM, saniScayaM, sTiracetasA.<BR>Ⓝ[Resolute]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹSee below.<BR>ⓃResolution,Ⓒs.ⒹniScayaH, nirRayaH, saMkalpaH, vyavasAyaH, sargaH, aDyavasA-yaH; sTira or dfQa-niScayaH or saMkalpaH, mati f., saMpra-ava-DAraRA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sTiratA, sTEryaM, DEryaM, Dfti f., nirbaMDaH, sTiramatitvaM, aBiniveSaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 viSlezaRaM, viyojanaM, viBedanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 upanyAsaH, pratijYA, upakzepaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

