resource
Resource,Ⓒs.ⒹupAyaH, gati f., prayukti f., kalpanA, sADanaM; ‘having no other r(esource)’ ananyagatika.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (‘r(esource)s’) viBavaH, dravyasA-DanaM, AyaH, vitta-dravya-sAmagrI, arTaH, DanaM; ‘of small r(esource)s’ alpaviBava.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

respect
Respect,Ⓒv. t.ⒹpUj 10, arc 1 P, 10; saM-man c., Adf 6 A, sev 1 A, Baj 1 U, saM-BU c., satkf 8 U, puraskf.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 apekz 1 A, uddiS 6 P; See Refer, Relate.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹapekzA, uddeSaH, saMbaMDaH, anuzaMgaH, vizayaH; ‘with r(espect) to the result’ PalApekzayA, PalamuddiSya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saM-, mAnaH, pUjA, aBi-, arcanaM, AdaraH, saMBAvanA, praSrayaH, gOravaM, puraskAraH, satkAraH, arhaRA, arcA, Bakti f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 dfzwi f., avekzA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 vizayaH, prakaraRaM; vastu n., arTaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 (‘r(espect)s’) namaskAraH, praRAmaH, praRati f., aBivaMdanaM, praRipAtaH, saBAjanaM; ‘in this r(espect)’ atra vizaye; ‘in all r(espect)s’ sarvaTA; ‘pay oneʼs r(espect)s’ praRam 1 P, saBAj 10, praRipat 1 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]able,Ⓒa.ⒹpUjya, mAnanIya, &c.; viSizwa, Arya, sapratizWa, guru; ‘a r(espectable) person’ Arya-su-janaH; ‘of a r(espectable) family’ aBijAta, aBijanavat, kulIna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 maDyama, sAmAnya, nAtiguru.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]ably,Ⓒadv.ⒹArya; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=394" target="_blank">Page394</a>] udAra, in comp.; Aryavat, Sizwavat, sagOravaM; ‘r(espectably) dressed’ udAranepaTyaBft, AryavezaDArin.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]ful,Ⓒa.ⒹsAdara, sapraSraya, sagOrava, savinaya, Adara-maryAdA-SIla, mAnapuraH-sara, Adara-mAna-pUrva.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]fully,Ⓒadv.ⒹsAdaraM, sapraSrayaM, savinayaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]ing,Ⓒa.ⒹuddiSya, aDikftya, apekzya; See Regarding.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]ive,Ⓒ(Own) a.ⒹEx. by sva-sva, (‘Own’ q. v.); ‘they went to their r(espective) houses’ svaM svaM gfhaM te jagmuH ‘in their r(espective) places’ svezu svezu sTAnezu.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sApekza, akevala, aDivikta, anyasaMbadDa; itaretara-anyonya in comp.<BR>Ⓝ[Respect]ively,Ⓒadv.ⒹyaTAkramaM, yaTAnukramaM, pOrvAparyeRa, pratyekaM pratyekaM.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

