safe
Safe,Ⓒa.Ⓓsurakzita, nirAbADa; susTa, kzema, akzata, nirvraRa, ajAtApAya.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nirBaya, akutoBaya, aBaya, niHSaMka, BayAtIta, Apad-Baya-mukta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 alaMGya, durAsada, durDarza; ‘s(afe) against enemies’ [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=406" target="_blank">Page406</a>] durAsadaH parEH (R. viii. 4).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 kzemya, Bayarahita, kzema, nirBaya; ‘a s(afe) place’ nirBayasTAnaM, aBayahetukaM sTalaM; ‘sound and s(afe)’ kuSalin, nirAmaya, susTa, akzata.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹlohapewikA, lohamaMjUzA; ‘s(afe) conduct’ aBayadAnaM-patraM; ‘s(afe)-guard’ rakzA, gupti f., rakzaRaM; Pass, q. v.<BR>Ⓝ[Safe]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹkzemeRa, nirAbADaM, akzataM, sakzemaM, nirBayaM; ‘when she is s(afely) brought to bed’ yadA anaGa-prasavA Bavati (S. 4).<BR>Ⓝ[Safe]ty,Ⓒs.ⒹkzemaH-maM, svAsTyaM, kzematA, akzataM, kuSalaM, anAmayaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 rakzA-kzaRaM, nirBayatvaM, aBayaM, nirBayaM, Baya-Apad-mukti f.; ‘to promise s(afety)’ aBaya-vacanaM dA 3 U.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

