Self,Ⓒa.ⒹAtman, sva in comp., svIya, nija; See Own; ‘s(elf)-interest’ AtmahitaM; ‘s(elf)-destroyer’ AtmaGAtakaH; (with pronoun) svayaM, svataH.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹAtman (sing. and m.); devI prAptaprasavamAtmAnaM gaMgAdevyAM vimuMcati (U. 7). In comp. ex. by Atma, sva, or svayaM, svataH; ‘s(elf)-accomplished’ Atmo-pArjita, svataH arjita; ‘s(elf)-command’ AtmasaMyamaH, damaH, iMdriyajayaH; ‘s(elf)-conceit’ ahaMkAraH mamatvaM, svABimAnaH; ‘s(elf)-denying’ AtmasaMyamin; ‘s(elf)-evident’ svataHsidDa, svayaMprakASa, pratyakza; ‘s(elf)-existent’ svayaMBU, AtmaBU; ‘s(elf)-interested’ svArTapara, svArTa-budDi; ‘s(elf)-love’ mamatA, ahaMmAnaH, svAnu-rAgaH; ‘s(elf)-possessed’ avyagra, sTirAtman, svasTacitta, Dftimat; ‘s(elf)-possession’ Dfti f., svAsTyaM, Atma-sva-nizWA; See Presence, (of mind); ‘s(elf)-sufficient’ svABimAnin; ‘s(elf)-will’ svecCA, svEritA, svAcCaMdyaM; ‘s(elf)-willed’ svEra, svErin, svacCaMda, kAma-svecCA-cArin, kAmavftti, svEragati.<BR>Ⓝ[Self]ish,Ⓒa.ⒹsvArTapara-nizWa-parAyaRa; udaraMBari, svArTadfzwi-budDi, svahitapara-nizWa, svahitEzin, svalABanizWa-tatpara, &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Self]ishly,Ⓒadv.ⒹsvArTadfzwyA, AtmahitabudDyA, svalABecCayA.<BR>Ⓝ[Self]ishness,Ⓒs.ⒹsvArTa-svalABa-svahita-paratA-nizWA-budDi f. dfzwi f., svalA-BecCA, mamatA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sell
Sell,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓvi-krI 9 A (rarely P also).<BR>Ⓔv. i.ⒹmUlyena vikrI pass.; ‘this picture will s(ell) for a large price’ mahatA mUlyeneda-mAleKyaM vikrezyate.<BR>Ⓝ[Sell]er,Ⓒs.Ⓓvikretf m., vikra-yin m., vikrayikaH, paRAyitA.<BR>Ⓝ[Sell]ing, Sale,Ⓒs.ⒹvikrayaH; paRanaM; ‘exposed for s(ale)’ krayya, krayArTaM prasArita; ‘an article for s(ale)’ paRyaM, paRyadravyaM; ‘underhand s(elling)’ avakrayaH.<BR>ⓃSaleable,Ⓒa.Ⓓvikreya.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

