send
Send,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓpra-hi 5 P, saM-, prez c., saM-, prer c., visfj 6 P or c., (with acc. of place and dat. of person); ‘s(end) away’ prasTA c. (sTApayati), visfj; ‘s(end) for’ Ahve 1 P, AnI c.; Agam c., Ahf c.; ‘s(end) for a doctor’ BizajamAhvAtuM kamapi pre-zaya; ‘s(end) forth’ ni-pra-sf c., udIr c. utkzip 6 P, udvam 1 P, ud-gF 6 P; (as a missile) pra-, muc 6 P, prakzip, prAs 4 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Send]er,Ⓒs.ⒹprezakaH, prerakaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

