shade
Shade,Ⓒs.ⒹCAyA, in all senses; ‘the dense s(hade) of sugarcanes’ ikzucCAyaM; ‘full of s(hade)’ pracCAyaM; anAtapaH, aprakASaH, nirAtapasTAnaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 aMDakAraH, timiraM, tamas n.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vyavaDA-DAnaM, tiraskariRI, vitAnaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 kramaH, BAgaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 Ghost, q. v.; ‘s(hade) of difference’ sUkzmaBedaH, svalpAMtaraM; ‘s(hade) of meaning’ arTasya sUkzmaBedaH; ‘like a picture with all its s(hade)s painted by a pencil’ unmI-litaM tUlikayeva citraM (K. i. 32); ‘cast^1 into s(hade)’ tiraskf 8 U, pratyAdiS 6 P; See Back-ground.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹCad 10, pra-A-°, vitan, 8 U.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 AtapaM nivAr 10, anAtapa a. kf.<BR>Ⓝ[Shad]y,Ⓒa.ⒹpracCAya, sacCAya, CAyAbahula-Avfta-yukta-sanATa; nirAtapa, Ataparahita, CAyA in comp.; ‘a s(hady) tree’ CAyAvfkzaH.<BR>ⓃShadow,Ⓒs.ⒹCAyA, praticCAyA, pratibiMbaM, pratimA, pratirUpaM, pratimUrti f.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ASrayaH, SaraRaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 tamas n., aMDakAraH; ‘deep s(hadow)s’ gAQatamaH pawalAni.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 gaMDaH, leSaH, ABAsaH.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓpra-A-cCad 10.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 ABAsaM dfS c., pratibiMbayati (D.).<BR>Ⓝ[Shadow]y,Ⓒa.ⒹCAyArUpa, asAra, CAyAtmaka, avAstavika (kI f.), miTyA-mfzA in comp.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 maMdacCAya, maMdakAMti-praBa, maMda-nyUna-tejas; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=421" target="_blank">Page421</a>] See Dim, Faint.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170109. note: Print missing left quote.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

