sharp
Sharp,Ⓒa.ⒹtIkzRa, in all senses tIkzRA budDiH, tIkzRA varzaDArA, tIkzRo daMqaH &c.; ni-, SAta, ni-, Sita, pra-, Kara, tigma, tIvra, tIkzRa-Sita-DAra, sUcyagra, tIkzRAgra ‘s(harp) descending arrows’ niSitanipAtAH SarAH (S. 1).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Intellect) atipradIpta sUkzma, tIkzRa, sUkzma-SIGra-grAhin. (of persons) tIkzRamati, kuSAgrabudDi-mati, sUkzma-SIGra-tIvra-mati, pradIptaprajYa, vidagDa, nipuRa, pawu, catura, kuSala; (in action) SIGra, ASu-kzipra-kArin, tIkzRa-karman.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 sarasa, vidagDa, rasika.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 amla, Sukta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 kawu, ugra, (smell &c.)<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 kawu, ugra, tIvra tIkzRa, paruza, aruMtuda, mamaspfS-Bid; ‘s(harp) pain’ tIvravedanA; ‘s(harp) language’ paruzavacanaM, vAgasiH; ‘s(harp) sound’ karkaSaDvaniH; ‘s(harp)-edged’ tIkzRa [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=422" target="_blank">Page422</a>] niSitaDAra, DArAsanATa; ‘s(harp)-pointed’ tIkzRAgra, sUcyagra; ‘s(harp)-set’ tIvrakzuDAgrasta, atiprabalakzuDAvasanna; ‘s(harp)-shooter’ lakzya-veDin; ‘s(harp)-sighted’ tIkzRa-sUkzma-dfzwi, &c.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹudAttaH; udAtta-ucca-svaraH.<BR>Ⓝ[Sharp]en,Ⓒv. t.Ⓓni-, So 4 P, uttij c., SARayati (D.), tIkzRIkf 8 U, kzRu 2 P; (appetite) ut-buD c., pra-, ruc c., dIp c.<BR>Ⓝ[Sharp]er,Ⓒs.ⒹvaMcakaH, DUrtaH; See Rogue.<BR>Ⓝ[Sharp]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹtIkzRaM, tIvraM, praKaraM, ugraM, paruzaM, &c.<BR>Ⓝ[Sharp]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹtIkzRatA, kuSAgra-matitvaM, matiprakarzaH, pAwavaM, pAruzyaM, kArkaSyaM &c.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

