sleep
Sleep,Ⓒv. i.Ⓓsvap 2 P, SI 2 A, saMviS 6 P, ni-drA 2 P, nidrAyate (D.); ‘I also do not s(leep) over this matter’ mayApyasmin vastuni na SayAnena sTIyate (Mu. 1).<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹnidrA, svapnaH, svApaH, supti f., SayanaM, saMveSaH; ‘go to s(leep)’ nidrAM yA 2 P; See (v.); ‘fall into s(leep)’ nidrayA aBiBU pass. or Akram pass.; ‘he fell into a deep s(leep)’ gAQa-nidrABiBUtaH-viDeyaH-baBUva; ‘death-s(leep)’ Gora-kAla-nidrA; ‘roused from s(leep)’ vinidra, Bagnanidra, praboDita.<BR>Ⓝ[Sleep]er,Ⓒs.ⒹnidrAluH, SayAluH, better by (v.).<BR>Ⓝ[Sleep]ing,Ⓒs.ⒹSayanaM, nidrA, &c.; ‘s(leeping)-house’ SayanamaMdiraM-gfhaM.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹnidrARa, Sayita, SayAna, supta; ‘s(leeping) draught’ nidrAkaramOzaDaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Sleep]less,Ⓒa.Ⓓnazwanidra, unnidra, a-vi-nidra, nirRidra; ‘passes s(leepless) nights’ unnidrAH-utsannanidrAH-kzapA gamayati.<BR>Ⓝ[Sleep]lessness,Ⓒs.ⒹnidrAnASaH, nirRidratA, nidrABAvaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Sleep]y,Ⓒa.ⒹnidrAlu, SayAlu, taMdrAlu, nidrASIla.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 nidrAkrAMta, nidrApara-vaSa-viDeya-aBiBUta-Akula-grasta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 nidrAprada-janana (nI f.), svApakara (rI f.).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 suzupsu, SiSayizu, SayanecCu; ‘to feel s(leepy)’ svap-SI- desid.; ‘I feel s(leepy)’ nidrayA'pahriye-parABUye, suzupsAmi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

