slip
Slip,Ⓒv. i.Ⓓpra-, sKal 1 P, (fig. also); vaca-nAni sKalayan pade pade (K. iv. 12) ‘making their words slip’. &c.; cal 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 sahasA-alakzitaM-ajYAtaH-nirgam 1 P or a-pasfp 1 P.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 (Off) cyu 1 A, pra-, BraMS 1 A, 4 P, sraMs 1 A, nir-, gal 1 P, pat 1 P; ‘s(lip) away’ vyapa-yA 2 P, apasfp-gam^1; See Slink; ‘s(lip) in’ alakzitaM A-pra-viS 6 P; ‘let s(lip) an opportunity’ avasaraM-samayaM na grah 9 U or avakzip 6 P.<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹalakzitaM ni-DA 3 U or pra-ni-viS c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 vi-, muc 6 P, kzip, BraMS c.; avagaR 10, upekz 1 A, cyu c. tyaj 1 P; See Neglect.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 Si-TilIkf 8 U, sraMs c., SiTilayati (D.); See Loose.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹsKalanaM, sKalitaM, (fig. also); ‘s(lip) as to names’ gotrasKalitaM; pra-, BraMSaH, cyuti f., patanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 dozaH, pramAdaH, aparADaH, BramaH, sKalitaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 viwapaH, SAKA, pallavaH, kAMqaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 KaMqaH-qaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Slip]pery,Ⓒa.ⒹpicCi-la, medura, cikkaRa, snigDa, SlakzRa; ‘s(lippery) ground’ nipatyA, picCilaBUmiH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 asTira, cala, lola, tarala, anavasTita, capala, caMcala; See Fickle.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170105. note: scan unclear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

