soul
Soul,Ⓒs.ⒹAtman m.; ‘individual s(oul)’ pra-tyagAmA, vijYAnAtmA; ‘rational s(oul)’ cidA-tmA ‘supreme s(oul)’ paramAtmA, brahman n.; ‘animating s(oul)’ jIvAtmA, prARaH, cetanaH, jIvaH; ‘embodied s(oul)’ dehin m., SArIrAtmA, SarIrin m., prARAtmA, kzetrajYaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 AtmA, cetas n., cittaM, manas n., hfdayaM; See Mind; ‘possessed of a large s(oul)’ mahAtman, udA-racetas; ‘oneness of s(oul)’ cittEkyaM, Ekya-BAvaH; ‘the whole s(oul)’ sarvAtmA, sarvaBAvaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 jIvanaM, sAraH; tattvaM, sAra or tattva-BAgaH or aMSaH, sAraBUtaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 (Self) AtmA, svaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 vIryaM, balaM, utsAhaH, tejas.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 Person, q. v. ‘the departed s(oul)’ pretaH, pretanaraH; ‘heart and s(oul)’ pra-ni-kAmaM, sarvAtmanA, sarva-BAvena; See Heart; ‘he throws his heart and s(oul) into the work’ susamAhi-tena cetasA-sarvAtmanA kArye pravartate-vyApriyate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

sound
Sound,Ⓒs.ⒹSabdaH, ni-, nAdaH, DvaniH, ni-, sva-(svA)naH, nihrAdaH, svaraH, ninadaH, nir-, GozaH, rAvaH, ravaH, vi-saMrAvaH ni-, svA(Dva)naH, svanitaM; ‘musical s(ound)’ nikvA(kva)RaH, kvaRitaM; ‘confused s(ound)’ kolAhalaH, kalakalaH, tumularavaH; ‘rattling s(ound)’ raRaH, raRitaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 saMDisAgaraH.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹsusTa, arugRa, kalya, nirAmaya, anAmaya, nIroga, nIruja, prakftisTa, vyADirahita; (in body) akzataSarIra, avi-kaleMdriya (in mind) anupahatacitta, avipluta, avAtula, avikzipta.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 akzata, ajAtakzata, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=437" target="_blank">Page437</a>] a-nir-vraRa, kzata-vraRa-hIna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 sasAra, sAravat, sAragarBa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 avikala, anyUna, aKaMqa, aBinna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 tIkzRa, tIvra; nirBara, pra-, gAQa, su-ati pr.; ‘s(ound) sleep’ gAQanidrA; ‘s(ound) beating’ tIkzRadaMqaH, atitAqanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 nirdoza, nicCidra, viSudDa, dozahIna.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 gAQa, ga(gaM)BIra, agADa, supariRata, paripakva.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		8 (Argument &c.) aKaMqya, sapramARa, dfQa-su-pramARa, nyAyya, Darmya, yuktisidDa.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		9 (In views) viSudDAcAra; satyamArgAnuyAyin.<BR>Ⓔv. i.Ⓓni-, nad 1 P, Dvan 1 P, svan 1 P, kvaR 1 P, hrAd 1 A, vi-, ru 2 P, stan-ras- 1 P, SabdaM kf 8 U, SabdAyate (D.).<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹDvan c., svan c., nad c.; vad c., A-DmA 1 P, muKamArutena pUr 10, (trumpet, conch &c.); (drum) taq 10, Ahan 2 U; ‘the drum being s(ound)ed’ AhatAyAM BeryAM; (bow) AsPal c.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 parIkz 1 A, sUkzmaM-nipuRaM-nirUp 10 or anusaM-DA 3 U, jYA desid. (jijYAsate).<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 ud-Guz 10, praKyA c. (KyApayati), prakAS c., prakawIkf; ‘s(ound) the depth’ talaM avagAh 1 A, ‘s(ound) the depth of water’ jalaveDaM parimA 3 A, 2 P.<BR>Ⓝ[Sound]ing,Ⓒa.ⒹSabdana, muKara, SabdAyamAna, ninAdin, ninadat, GozaRa, garjat, nirhrAdin, Sabdakara (rI f.); ‘s(ounding) lead’ laMbaH, laMbasIsakaM.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹDvAnanaM, SabdanaM, vAdanaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 veDaparimARa, talAvagAhanaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Sound]ly,Ⓒadv.ⒹtIvaM, tIkzRaM, atyaMtaM, pra-, gAQaM; nirBaraM, dfQaM, suKena, su-ati pr.<BR>Ⓝ[Sound]ness,Ⓒs.ⒹsvAsTyaM, kalyatA, ArogyaM, akzatatvaM, nirvraRatvaM, avEkalyaM, anyUnatA, aKaMqyatA, nirdozatA, &c.; ‘s(oundness) of mind’ cittasvAsTyaM, aviplavaH.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

