AtaH; ‘s(troke) of a thunder-bolt’ vajrapAtaH, aSanipAtaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 reKA, leKA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 AkramaH, avatAraH, AveSaH, laMGanaM; ‘sun-s(troke)’ AtapalaM-GanaM, sUryABiGAtaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		4 prayatnaH, AkasmikayatnaH; ‘s(troke) of policy’ nItyutkarzaH, nayanipuRatA.<BR>Ⓔv. t.Ⓓ(pARinA-hastena) parAmfS 6 P, spfS 6 P; (parAmfSan harzajaqena pARinA R. iii. 68); SanEH mfj 2 P or samAlaB 1 A, hastena lal 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=450" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

