time
Time,Ⓒs.ⒹkAlaH, samayaH, velA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 (Occasion) avasaraH, prasaMgaH, prastAvaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 vAraH, vAsaraH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 avaDiH, maryAdA.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		5 tAlaH, layaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		6 (Personified) kAlaH.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		7 (With numerals) guRaM, kftvaH, vAraM, in comp.; ‘10 t(ime)s’ daSakftvaH; sahasraguRaM, trivAraM, &c.; ‘from t(ime) to t(ime)’ kAle kAle; ‘losing or wasting t(ime)’ kAlaharaRaM kAlakzepaH-hAniH; ‘by this t(ime)^1’ anena samayena, iyatA kAlena; ‘after a long t(ime)’ cirAt, bahoH kAlAt; ‘for a long t(ime)’ cira, mahAMtaM kAlaM; ‘of the same t(ime)’ samakAlIna, samakAlika (kI f.); ‘at the right t(ime)’ kAle, yaTA-vasaraM, prAptakAlaM; ‘in time’ yaTAsamayaM-avasaraM, kAle; ‘in a short t(ime)’ acireRa-rAt; ‘at the t(ime) when’ yadA-tadA; ‘at the same t(ime)’ samaM, ekAvasaraM, tatkAlaM, tatkzaRaM; ‘at all t(ime)s’ sadA, sarvadA; ‘at other t(ime)’ anyadA; ‘at t(ime)s’ kAle kAle, aMtarA aMtarA; ‘at this, that, t(ime)’ aDunA, tadA; ‘at any t(ime)’ yadA kadA; ‘come at any t(ime)’ yadA icCasi tadA-yaTe-zwakAle-AgacCa; ‘of our, those, t(ime)s’ idAnIMtana-tadAnIMtana- (nI f.); ‘high t(ime)’ ucitaH samayaH; ‘it is high t(ime) to bathe and take our meals’ samayaH snAnaBojanaM sevituM (V. 2); ‘good for the t(ime) being’ ApAtaramaRIya, ApAtato ramya; ‘hard t(ime)s’ ApatkAlaH; vipatsamayaH, Apad f.; ‘dark t(ime)s’ kalikAlaH; ‘from t(ime) to t(ime)’ anuvelaM, vAraMvAraM; ‘many t(ime)s’ bahuSaH, bahuvAraM, kAle kAle; ‘t(ime)-server’, ‘t(ime)-serving’ kAlA-nuvartin, samayAnuroDin; ‘I shall not do so next t(ime)’ nEvaM vArAMtaraM viDAsyAmi; ‘what is the t(ime) now’ kA velA aDunA vartate; ‘begging is out of t(ime)’ anavasaragrastorTiBAvaH (Mal. 9); ‘sign of the t(ime)’ kAlaDarmaH; ‘without loss of t(ime)’ akAla-kzepeRa, avilaMbitaM; ‘one keeping or beating t(ime) with the hands’ pARiGaH, pARivAdaH; karakisalayatAlErmugDayA nartyamAnaH (U. 3) ‘by keeping t(ime) with her hands’ &c.; ‘quick, mean, slow, t(ime)’ drutaM, maDyaM, vilaM-bitaM; ‘out of t(ime)’ vitAla, vEtAlika (kI f.).<BR>Ⓔv. t.ⒹkAlaM, nirRI 1 P or parikxp c., kAlAnurUpa a. kf 8 U.<BR>Ⓝ[Time]ly,Ⓒa.ⒹEx. by (s.) in comp.; ‘showering t(imely)’ kAla-samaya-varziRaH; sAmayika (kI f.); kAlakftodyo-gAt ‘by t(imely) attempts’.<BR>Ⓔadv.ⒹkAle, yaTA-samayaM-kAlaM.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20170120. note: print missing period.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=470" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

