Worth,Ⓒs.ⒹarGaH-rGaM, mUlyaM; See Value.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 guRaH, utkarzaH, sAravattA.<BR>Ⓔa.ⒹarGa, mUlya, arha in comp.; ex. by pot. pass. part. or arh 1 P; ‘w(orth) considering’ vicArArha, vicAramarhati, vicArya; ‘w(orth) much’ bahumUlya; ‘w(orth) little’ alpArGa; ‘w(orth) while’ sAMprata, ucita, SramArha.<BR>Ⓝ[Worth]less,Ⓒa.ⒹnirguRa, guRahIna, nirarTaka, asAra, akiMcitkara (rI f.), sAra-guRa-hIna, alpamUlya, tfRaprAya, aDama, kutsita; See Mean; oft. by a in comp.; adravyaM, apAtraM ‘a w(orthless) object’.<BR>ⓃWorthy,Ⓒa.Ⓓyogya, ucita, arha, sadfSa, anurUpa, or by pot. pass. part. or arh; ‘a pupil w(orthy) of the name’ paramArTataH yaH SizyaH, yaH SizyanAmArhaH; ‘having a husband w(orthy) of her’ anurUpaBartfgAminI (S.); ‘a w(orthy) object’ pAtraM, satpAtraM, guRAspadaM.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		2 Arya, mAnya, pUjya, Bagavat.<BR>Ⓑ<BR>		3 guRin, guRavat, guRopeta.<BR>Ⓔs.ⒹmAnyajanaH, AryaH, janaH, sajjanaH.<BR>Ⓝ[Worth]ily,Ⓒadv.ⒹyogyatayA, ucitaM, yaTArTaM, upapannaM.<BR>Ⓝ[Worth]iness,Ⓒs.ⒹyogyatA, arhatA, guRaH, pAtratA.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=AE&page=498" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ae" target="_blank">Correction</a>

